s","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/railgrid/commit/e2ef8478b0e82c84809e8831ffda7fafed1f5bbf","node_id":"C_kwDORSHIc9oAKGUyZWY4NDc4YjBlODJjODQ4MDllODgzMWZmZGE3ZmFmZWQxZjViYmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/railgrid/commit/257d460a5ef516bd6d79a7a19d6aee8537b439b1","sha":"257d460a5ef516bd6d79a7a19d6aee8537b439b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/commits/257d460a5ef516bd6d79a7a19d6aee8537b439b1"}],"sha":"e2ef8478b0e82c84809e8831ffda7fafed1f5bbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/commits/e2ef8478b0e82c84809e8831ffda7fafed1f5bbf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3225744?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mjudeikis","id":3225744,"login":"mjudeikis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjU3NDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/commits/257d460a5ef516bd6d79a7a19d6aee8537b439b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T18:17:58Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T18:17:58Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Let a harness-backed agent run against a repository (#790)\n\n* Let a harness-backed agent run against a repository\n\nA run may now name a repository: a runner repository id, a base commit,\na clone source whose token is dispatch data, and the subject the result\ncommit must carry. The harness backend dispatches it as a repository\nattempt — a fresh checkout at the pinned commit, no workspace and no\nchat session — and asks the runner to export its git result. On the\ncompleted receipt the backend fetches git-result.json and the bundle,\nverifies them against the request and each other, stores them with the\nrun, and writes the typed result onto the Run''s status; a result that\ndoes not hold together fails the run with the reason.\n\nA new read-only verb, runs/{id}/artifact, hands a stored artifact back.\nA coordinator that owns the repository — Factory — can now hand its\ncoding work to an Agent instead of driving a runner itself.\n\n* Record a repository run''s request on its first write\n\n* Let Factory claim the agents group instead of edges\n\n* Re-read a pull request soon after advancing its branch\n\n* Let a repository run through without asking for permission","tree":{"sha":"8ea483dcc7f5fe34b771ada2c76fe1116d8ea662","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/git/trees/8ea483dcc7f5fe34b771ada2c76fe1116d8ea662"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/git/commits/257d460a5ef516bd6d79a7a19d6aee8537b439b1","verification":{"payload":"tree 8ea483dcc7f5fe34b771ada2c76fe1116d8ea662\nparent 75433e2cb6ebe3c2586bdf1b4088c71c816e1bdf\nauthor Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt> 1791310678 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791310678 +0300\n\nLet a harness-backed agent run against a repository (#790)\n\n* Let a harness-backed agent run against a repository\n\nA run may now name a repository: a runner repository id, a base commit,\na clone source whose token is dispatch data, and the subject the result\ncommit must carry. The harness backend dispatches it as a repository\nattempt — a fresh checkout at the pinned commit, no workspace and no\nchat session — and asks the runner to export its git result. On the\ncompleted receipt the backend fetches git-result.json and the bundle,\nverifies them against the request and each other, stores them with the\nrun, and writes the typed result onto the Run''s status; a result that\ndoes not hold together fails the run with the reason.\n\nA new read-only verb, runs/{id}/artifact, hands a stored artifact back.\nA coordinator that owns the repository — Factory — can now hand its\ncoding work to an Agent instead of driving a runner itself.\n\n* Record a repository run''s request on its first write\n\n* Let Factory claim the agents group instead of edges\n\n* Re-read a pull request soon after advancing its branch\n\n* Let a repository run through without asking for permission","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxTtWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAydEQABGuw4MwcMQjkPyL9FDa8rjl\nqjvhy3dQipmYFYXgIx7q1sUQeeFQI2cqSnBLOZbKBtFZ3e2EU4dJPXxho91CpaDb\nDtGRnjKmlR+kwvWnHxjHdCs0LhHNs57kumCtow3Eq3yAt95dbJT2abklFmFz5FSN\nkygf5Wu9CNjJm/FmIn9/mkg1Q5Z17ATMM7IsWaMkraq3gu5HYRsZH3jVZ4dGPv+a\nr8IiKB2b10/PP6DbHiSfHNQs3+onD9J4MJsSk++jncik8IwXfPNzY2lvB1Wotzsq\nO6BA4NzMZeXgjUJ7qGx3pwHrRUk/VUoE6sJztYKW0H8iiYaAXiL0C7UzQ0bt1/lo\npgAeK3dpYJsijetDUl9MYcoXiXfTzF4ky8zlMiuj8Ak96VRbdJFHlESYn4SjzCx8\ngUUo4TmvCTG7hc9f5zRHWae9Bh1uxP9DFYDn0goVTUxJrjthzcyShhLREfK9OJwM\nliGgW/Vbmm9mzs5pUEBLbD++vgnSq2ybWb7fmGiy/PqGoYyrjnTkx3oDnB8UIkLL\nWRq9q6nD5b3kLmnXu7wSm8FC7xqfsxjkFMDkgp+cAvvTsh8JYBCfKbVOgoEE2yn3\nVTWf4p2tv3rLQ1eNHCcIFz2xssCCiAoB7qYf0teBYzdtE5slZTsRd2SJowQuUL3W\nlv8QhWpHs/rujz1IY0Ql\n=Iwvm\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T18:17:59Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/railgrid/commit/257d460a5ef516bd6d79a7a19d6aee8537b439b1","node_id":"C_kwDORSHIc9oAKDI1N2Q0NjBhNWVmNTE2YmQ2ZDc5YTdhMTlkNmFlZTg1MzdiNDM5YjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/railgrid/commit/75433e2cb6ebe3c2586bdf1b4088c71c816e1bdf","sha":"75433e2cb6ebe3c2586bdf1b4088c71c816e1bdf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/commits/75433e2cb6ebe3c2586bdf1b4088c71c816e1bdf"}],"sha":"257d460a5ef516bd6d79a7a19d6aee8537b439b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/commits/257d460a5ef516bd6d79a7a19d6aee8537b439b1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3225744?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mjudeikis","id":3225744,"login":"mjudeikis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjU3NDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/commits/75433e2cb6ebe3c2586bdf1b4088c71c816e1bdf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T17:49:23Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T17:49:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Let an edge re-enroll after its credential expires (#789)\n\nThe agent cannot mint or renew its ServiceAccount credential; the\nprovider re-mints it before expiry. An edge offline for longer than that\nlifetime comes back with a credential the provider refuses (\"token not\nauthenticated\") and a refresh it cannot authenticate for, so it falls\nback to its join token — which registration cleared. The provider then\nanswers \"has no join token set\" and the edge stays locked out until an\noperator regenerates the token by hand.\n\nKeep status.joinTokenHash, the SHA-256 of the issued token, after the\nplaintext is cleared, and accept a presented token that matches it. The\nagent re-enrolls with the token already on its disk and recovers on its\nown. The plaintext still disappears from status on registration, and\nrotating through the regenerate annotation replaces the digest, so the\nprevious token stops enrolling.","tree":{"sha":"f42f78c2f1776698f117512b2d9c217dbf8fcf67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/git/trees/f42f78c2f1776698f117512b2d9c217dbf8fcf67"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/git/commits/75433e2cb6ebe3c2586bdf1b4088c71c816e1bdf","verification":{"payload":"tree f42f78c2f1776698f117512b2d9c217dbf8fcf67\nparent 726052b8cee6c318cac0cff574f057501a94047e\nauthor Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt> 1791308963 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791308963 +0300\n\nLet an edge re-enroll after its credential expires (#789)\n\nThe agent cannot mint or renew its ServiceAccount credential; the\nprovider re-mints it before expiry. An edge offline for longer than that\nlifetime comes back with a credential the provider refuses (\"token not\nauthenticated\") and a refresh it cannot authenticate for, so it falls\nback to its join token — which registration cleared. The provider then\nanswers \"has no join token set\" and the edge stays locked out until an\noperator regenerates the token by hand.\n\nKeep status.joinTokenHash, the SHA-256 of the issued token, after the\nplaintext is cleared, and accept a presented token that matches it. The\nagent re-enrolls with the token already on its disk and recovers on its\nown. The plaintext still disappears from status on registration, and\nrotating through the regenerate annotation replaces the digest, so the\nprevious token stops enrolling.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxTSjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAiJcQAGS0DJ8xJuSUE2ifY77khJJL\n7GRi2RjCe82ds6kUSEhOE5kqdoG7hFy5Z2ridK4m4XHTvrkeLYxHJeFicxg8XI9O\ndOeVBA3jhENLrFWfz1vXRPz5s89Ye8GSRXhnB5JkudT9IlcEabCXDZ6QnyQXBzb2\nd4dO4LF3qhkz+uigcqzrwuvpo+Ov0umk+3hgE1i56nldrw+TSX4CDhFi8uWTadvi\nea0D5gbnfclO0syc+FXfU8kLrj3zO921UQlqDsRqd/S0xD+K1zlZ/kq6CH7aZm6K\nfLPnLGnu0M7TMfUz/OozJO6L/iShuvDjob3wF/VeGNQYFwm2ub4jgiuTlUm9Lq2O\n1k8LacCgJAStkX4RzrwVCGoGLJpnbUQk/uvWKOgjiOczQ2B286oYZk/55REuBssS\neSKIuhHx8BGcZkLSI6f2PWXEskgt8bvMZb7Oq1d/vai//ssOctNuPvqjnlrMEb+l\nNru8Y4jESf4aeN8gBPOqiULqKoinldG+fAqoOAiLXd/PwqdXYScku7Diw2FfCZPh\nKCgOXNPICdqrcylJoApAN/f2vQlf+dZ24K13osXAuBlYEZzBN3aGMZpbas83aoLR\nK68p20voazYQyvSSYreI1ogmzm/wpfms/U10f6oF35j/CO8nq3J6vXqp80FAJxna\nrzDnTd0wZYu6KmiPk