"gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cwilhit","id":5685031,"login":"cwilhit","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2ODUwMzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/commits/726052b8cee6c318cac0cff574f057501a94047e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T22:02:49Z","email":"cdwilhite0601@gmail.com","name":"Craig D Wilhite"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T22:02:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Align Agents setup, recovery, and reporting with design standards (#788)\n\n* Fix Agents API flows and Tilt development wiring\n\nAllow gpt-6-luna tool requests by explicitly disabling reasoning, recover\nprogress and cancellation controls after disconnected chat streams, and\nrevalidate triggers when their referenced connections change.\n\nCorrect latency percentiles and clarify that spend estimates omit unpriced\nusage. Watch the remaining Agents Go sources in Tilt and resolve\nhost.docker.internal for external provider pods on Linux.\n\nValidated with 580 portal tests, focused Go suites, UI conformance checks,\nand live Tilt chat, history, tool, approval, webhook, and schedule smoke tests.\nRoot formatting/lint and changed-code provider lint pass; full provider lint\nstill reports five pre-existing findings.\n\n* fix(agents): align setup, recovery, and reporting with design standards\n\n* fix(agents): expire abandoned model verification credentials\n\n* fix(agents): harden diagnostic redaction and approval refresh","tree":{"sha":"64c7ed9841b97932c7c0f9d129537df45a356821","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/git/trees/64c7ed9841b97932c7c0f9d129537df45a356821"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/git/commits/726052b8cee6c318cac0cff574f057501a94047e","verification":{"payload":"tree 64c7ed9841b97932c7c0f9d129537df45a356821\nparent f76222b910f0f764a0a265721fb30843973d1c73\nauthor Craig D Wilhite <cdwilhite0601@gmail.com> 1791237769 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791237769 -0500\n\nAlign Agents setup, recovery, and reporting with design standards (#788)\n\n* Fix Agents API flows and Tilt development wiring\n\nAllow gpt-6-luna tool requests by explicitly disabling reasoning, recover\nprogress and cancellation controls after disconnected chat streams, and\nrevalidate triggers when their referenced connections change.\n\nCorrect latency percentiles and clarify that spend estimates omit unpriced\nusage. Watch the remaining Agents Go sources in Tilt and resolve\nhost.docker.internal for external provider pods on Linux.\n\nValidated with 580 portal tests, focused Go suites, UI conformance checks,\nand live Tilt chat, history, tool, approval, webhook, and schedule smoke tests.\nRoot formatting/lint and changed-code provider lint pass; full provider lint\nstill reports five pre-existing findings.\n\n* fix(agents): align setup, recovery, and reporting with design standards\n\n* fix(agents): expire abandoned model verification credentials\n\n* fix(agents): harden diagnostic redaction and approval refresh","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxB6JCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxBoQAKtiKtUpNkZX89QedYebCCD7\nZ7Ef2XiHwjDwc9y5fu6E3SDjqDF7T/xJJC1Jj4tlEzKYB22wxZmri8+rSw6BdjaP\nyYAnz9I2GqT6OE2UG74W2a1lihxfNnCnHMMb555+yqOIWIyOLXu3huJ6zTke06uD\nyxOMtVYEsE+h5JE02jGL7XDuS56mFoKINDNMy/mpr345YnydY8A88LNTCxgc2yzM\nTbf96sXhjRTBePVRbkXp3m1yqVoooIDKiBqSchUQJtLo1m76T8ROfjWfuT6ZplPC\nDRDfFGMUocFHp7S/FuGBOQ93D7keWz45Lxvr+0C5e2wN/iXuVzQkiZ8ZQyD/5bXx\nXTgCss7V+8iLsnnAr9Vwv2vsTFfx6Z