admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/commits/e35497c6d9658da27b357611099456d312d156d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T17:19:53Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T17:19:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Let the infrastructure serve pod run TokenReviews (#760)\n\nProvider Actions workload attestation does an online TokenReview of the\ndev pod''s projected bootstrap token on the runtime cluster, but the\nchart''s serve ClusterRole never granted tokenreviews (the existing rule\nlives in the kcp-side runtime role). Every review failed, the hub\nanswered the sandbox''s token exchange with 403, and action-enabled dev\npods never went Ready. Grant tokenreviews/create and log review and\npod-lookup failures, which the hub deliberately hides from callers.","tree":{"sha":"37a5ab7d89deae3a9e4920021b00dd5ad3a7e496","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/git/trees/37a5ab7d89deae3a9e4920021b00dd5ad3a7e496"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/git/commits/e35497c6d9658da27b357611099456d312d156d6","verification":{"payload":"tree 37a5ab7d89deae3a9e4920021b00dd5ad3a7e496\nparent c1649c18a1b88b6794c9fa1c111da0418754e730\nauthor Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt> 1789579193 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789579193 +0300\n\nLet the infrastructure serve pod run TokenReviews (#760)\n\nProvider Actions workload attestation does an online TokenReview of the\ndev pod''s projected bootstrap token on the runtime cluster, but the\nchart''s serve ClusterRole never granted tokenreviews (the existing rule\nlives in the kcp-side runtime role). Every review failed, the hub\nanswered the sandbox''s token exchange with 403, and action-enabled dev\npods never went Ready. Grant tokenreviews/create and log review and\npod-lookup failures, which the hub deliberately hides from callers.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqs+5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA+ZIQAJzPToxbDPz0ctD3NMRz6Qwk\nNSiT+FQc5ii7hMfcqtRJWTOUxD5DMgSCHePGwRKSTLgWXg0DY5qqvTIk1yLvTgU3\ne2LDS7af2yesWOAfD/U3rvBoy87AwcZ65mClcRM6z1pDbTGaMYiMd0kGDLEfNcaf\no5BOWscCImBXKmLCIZHQE2DalJfM/iFbpt1iZfR5tdXvo3WubFeOm+I7O8SlLxXV\nSM2pxl0ApIFdM92xyxoH1Wd4xVk7mjCF8rmj8H1GXZ2ztx/GFEw08qWE7TbfAfaO\nlmapLKfUYDDTfuaX+xSbwphtj5mjEhtl0bhF32ok7lYUvZ1ZOVp+gkLGpoVZ/23R\nxFoJd2MnFp3iEl0EqzwyyEujymtW2FUcmcvIj/ji7nQkUtbCz2vxvIScHQChmuzM\nxe/heBMmEcan4qzF/W9GYfatRn3Nz6kIt4/qGSpxCd0H+BViek9BXb2R8Agk2Gha\nFR9QRjpjrOW8Ij6Pr1ROjQUR2sk8rYt6u7c93SpsHyHmrw63Kv6XA7Oe3cpnyHX0\nSDDvBEDJVNAjMxBD1QCEBSGgDzD2mdqhPbE4JdQB1vkMZ+sLz1SEjzsSYWAr9V3a\nCGIsv6tvPeLUmqPyqwA4E+IxIDYRmbfDhKNSwqOt8wk7L260aeXVIo60Ogrkdnm9\nCumiP2Hcnwtccid/0wXW\n=0IcH\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-16T17:19:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","