:"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/commits/8a31866c40311be06275c15b1e4f364e8d382f6f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T16:07:44Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T16:07:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Ship CA certificates in the dev-agent image (#759)\n\nThe platform coordinator runs directly from the scratch dev-agent image\nand calls the Provider Actions token exchange over public HTTPS. With no\ntrust store, every public certificate failed with \"x509: certificate\nsigned by unknown authority\", so the coordinator never became ready and\naction-enabled development pods stayed NotReady unless an explicit\nactions CA bundle was configured.","tree":{"sha":"6c625ec3bef40d8adc76e1a4e06759b3fbf133f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/git/trees/6c625ec3bef40d8adc76e1a4e06759b3fbf133f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/git/commits/8a31866c40311be06275c15b1e4f364e8d382f6f","verification":{"payload":"tree 6c625ec3bef40d8adc76e1a4e06759b3fbf133f2\nparent 42fd52e6204a62234484a0b8124764bdafb10f25\nauthor Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt> 1789574864 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789574864 +0300\n\nShip CA certificates in the dev-agent image (#759)\n\nThe platform coordinator runs directly from the scratch dev-agent image\nand calls the Provider Actions token exchange over public HTTPS. With no\ntrust store, every public certificate failed with \"x509: certificate\nsigned by unknown authority\", so the coordinator never became ready and\naction-enabled development pods stayed NotReady unless an explicit\nactions CA bundle was configured.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqr7QCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAUhoQACrs6HdipBxpDF+AKz5LUTw6\nKeLEfJ4eLIHfaWAOYAz