_PROVIDERS_DIR on make tilt /\nmake tilt-cluster; with EXTERNAL_PROVIDERS=all, providers missing local\nsetup are skipped with a warning.\n\ndocs/external-providers-tilt.md documents the settings and the contract a\nprovider repository implements.\n\n* Rename the infrastructure application template to 3-tier application","tree":{"sha":"83e4c3f1d3f2ac02b3ec96bf3371f797c34470ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/git/trees/83e4c3f1d3f2ac02b3ec96bf3371f797c34470ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/git/commits/42fd52e6204a62234484a0b8124764bdafb10f25","verification":{"payload":"tree 83e4c3f1d3f2ac02b3ec96bf3371f797c34470ce\nparent dd8a1bcf808e8c527216f76509c7d57385aa2581\nauthor Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt> 1789572171 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789572171 +0300\n\nLoad external provider repositories into the Tilt session (#758)\n\n* Load external provider repositories into the Tilt session\n\nTiltfile and Tiltfile.cluster can now load a provider repository''s\nhack/tilt/providers.tilt library (e.g. the private ../providers checkout)\nand hand it the stack''s hosting context, hub URL, kcp admin kubeconfig and\nresource dependencies. Opt-in via EXTERNAL_PROVIDERS_DIR on make tilt /\nmake tilt-cluster; with EXTERNAL_PROVIDERS=all, providers missing local\nsetup are skipped with a warning.\n\ndocs/external-providers-tilt.md documents the settings and the contract a\nprovider repository implements.\n\n* Rename the infrastructure application template to 3-tier application","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqrRLCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAZoQQACIRH6K55vY87zoh1Bp7ZRag\nD0Woy9F4Gte2TjApnSPSAi9yqSUzOvodfgA1UXL+ZoP78JaAbkwgbGvHv4i9V1XU\n4VQMKmKUUe4VNsViKlc0BATmUaNvFK5jGD7wbgQf4T/pElAY92icRQwAJUtaIMvf\nzQ8nKjqw6x6JEoW7XpcLJJynpCeCkAtUCBiKt4AeKVBhaY2h+27/M6vppHpEOGdc\ncmOd9b5/Qg0ncd2KTiBzm1/iI2XN7y53nSJs4imV3r2NpeccA7/e6Yx6zmdSqBjd\n2O+HihJiVgngIB7fecxfEbuanO1jrWrlaNkyxbSsrli65X