fb10f25"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3225744?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mjudeikis","id":3225744,"login":"mjudeikis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjU3NDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/commits/dd8a1bcf808e8c527216f76509c7d57385aa2581/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T14:58:42Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T14:58:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Hand App Studio projects over when their owner pod goes away (#757)\n\nProject claims were never released, so after a restart the replacement\npod forwarded every owner-affine request to its predecessor''s dead pod\nIP and answered 502 until the claim went stale (up to 10 minutes).\n\nOn shutdown, after the listeners drain, a replica now marks its project\nclaims stale, keeping the row and its revision floor, so the next\nrequest adopts the project at once. For a replica that dies without\nshutting down, a forward whose dial fails (request never sent, body\nunread) takes the claim over, only if the unreachable owner still holds\nit, and serves the request locally. Failures after connecting stay 502.","tree":{"sha":"e52e197efb79fc360707cdd0893ce77b710f6fe3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/git/trees/e52e197efb79fc360707cdd0893ce77b710f6fe3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/git/commits/dd8a1bcf808e8c527216f76509c7d57385aa2581","verification":{"payload":"tree e52e197efb79fc360707cdd0893ce77b710f6fe3\nparent 78f8f03ae8bb960bde577c01059474440fc81794\nauthor Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt> 1789570722 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789570722 +0300\n\nHand App Studio projects over when their owner pod goes away (#757)\n\nProject claims were never released, so after a restart the replacement\npod forwarded every owner-affine request to its predecessor''s dead pod\nIP and answered 502 until the claim went stale (up to 10 minutes).\n\nOn shutdown, after the listeners drain, a replica now marks its project\nclaims stale, keeping the row and its revision floor, so the next\nrequest adopts the project at once. For a replica that dies without\nshutting down, a forward whose dial fails (request never sent, body\nunread) takes the claim over, only if the unreachable owner still holds\nit, and serves the request locally. Failures after connecting stay 502.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqq6iCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAmTwQAFon4oeiN+R3WbCmKKx4C1Uc\niOL9MnXVa5KyUWZLiKXKr59JEFIsGSwJLw37P2bO4F4QLMtdZBsmT8Xl/ELVSBRI\nsFF/fkkItMyFdeflQ+j4WAWD1V3Y+MjHr72GM53cy/wGRjPcBi4yKIGzH0JAAz2n\n7Xu3LA41quKNBYu0NeNQPGdWwG5RAFa0w7/xSDPnGiEeCy1Gc1XrL9kJ1JBm0s+M\nU9OANj5IXhdux6ul0Q9LipObGQ+ireWRvy3fXX59OWVmrRiQFjueS+0b7Is992gy\nLdHpvwOtH1QR/+R9OF2ukxnHvFbJ7TiKLR6p8BUXL2YROgiEPTwe45Nn2aL/q91o\nHNl1ZiZet6V0sqEvO5wjxA0MXEtQhqoFx4ZZERxKn6g+v/AfmgMsWlO7TpyzU0+j\nPD6uYMxTrKqeqfJCZnUgiOF7h4Oh33Lkv23BmRRBiKoo9qWNCLWMw3Swq85r44Fv\nlqw5mEcIVAs+JKmIv8lyjsDr04a+rd3RcJqpKaY1OnlbC1DO9Sm0YmRF/WNgnkEF\nfJBqwFVfm2o5pmRIXbGpOvBLKQlZG8twHLkR6O49tWRdYUzw9hQ3Wr2DlZly+ViW\nZWvu0rUQXAQFPyaIOLKCH