ubscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/railgrid/commit/54508ec96425b78c669490eb482b0abf1cad176b","node_id":"C_kwDORSHIc9oAKDU0NTA4ZWM5NjQyNWI3OGM2Njk0OTBlYjQ4MmIwYWJmMWNhZDE3NmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/railgrid/commit/b36b202eb952501b55c7a6ff318a8ca7176dfa59","sha":"b36b202eb952501b55c7a6ff318a8ca7176dfa59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/commits/b36b202eb952501b55c7a6ff318a8ca7176dfa59"}],"sha":"54508ec96425b78c669490eb482b0abf1cad176b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/commits/54508ec96425b78c669490eb482b0abf1cad176b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3225744?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mjudeikis","id":3225744,"login":"mjudeikis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjU3NDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/commits/b36b202eb952501b55c7a6ff318a8ca7176dfa59/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T12:57:32Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T12:57:32Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Give LinuxServer edges their own agent credentials (#752)\n\nKubernetesCluster and LinuxServer edges both derived their agent\nServiceAccount, token/kubeconfig Secrets and proxy grant from\nedge-<name>. A LinuxServer and a KubernetesCluster with the same name in\none workspace therefore shared one credential: whichever kind reconciled\nfirst owned it, the other failed with \"already controlled by\", and the\nLinuxServer agent was handed a token whose proxy grant only covers the\nKubernetesCluster, so the delegated SubjectAccessReview rejected every\ntunnel reconnect with 401.\n\nName credentials per kind via a single EdgeCredentialName helper shared\nby the RBAC reconciler and the tunnel: KubernetesCluster keeps\nedge-<name>, LinuxServer gets linux-edge-<name>, MacOSServer keeps\nmacos-edge-<name>. The prefixes are disjoint, so no two edges collide.\n\nExisting LinuxServer agents keep working: their edge-<name> SA and proxy\ngrant are owned by the LinuxServer and are left in place.","tree":{"sha":"66a22f7f3f88250c765e7e89833d43e0abe659d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/git/trees/66a22f7f3f88250c765e7e89833d43e0abe659d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/git/commits/b36b202eb952501b55c7a6ff318a8ca7176dfa59","verification":{"payload":"tree 66a22f7f3f88250c765e7e89833d43e0abe659d5\nparent bd33dcfe044953f9340636437dee1733fd86294f\nauthor Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt> 1789563452 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789563452 +0300\n\nGive LinuxServer edges their own agent credentials (#752)\n\nKubernetesCluster and LinuxServer edges both derived their agent\nServiceAccount, token/kubeconfig Secrets and proxy grant from\nedge-<name>. A LinuxServer and a KubernetesCluster with the same name in\none workspace therefore shared one credential: whichever kind reconciled\nfirst owned it, the other failed with \"already controlled by\", and the\nLinuxServer agent was handed a token whose proxy grant only covers the\nKubernetesCluster, so the delegated SubjectAccessReview rejected every\ntunnel reconnect with 401.\n\nName credentials per kind via a single EdgeCredentialName helper shared\nby the RBAC reconciler and the tunnel: KubernetesCluster keeps\nedge-<name>, LinuxServer gets linux-edge-<name>, MacOSServer keeps\nmacos-edge-<name>. The prefixes are disjoint, so no two edges collide.\n\nExisting LinuxServer agents keep working: their edge-<name> SA and proxy\ngrant are owned by the LinuxServer and are left in place.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqpI8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8d4QACZ2zNnpITuD+ZF9GzLkBVzE\n2jcNU8swvQkAykCLtHeeeA/DWfsF4CSaeKnpgFBSsm/Z5fijt5rQ2sj+l6jl6JGs\nqU/bDKMCJARHqDUpJqa30MpF37sBmQJqsHqr2/NwG/g+aW/E1XugHSBKJcXw9WoD\n8dIHddgKW8M6T3UBmlQLalawOc+KJvU74jK8wGOeaVISiG2WfzvNcYgNJMS57HOh\n6/IhrJZKZ0TbNvUj8aVK9CD+KNF4dGO6M979ubMobk87tdc/wSKXPc71504eBcLY\npuEynrHP/Td6U22F/pjCoFGGmri1CaxEHwvT8n3oDlNB+ktm4xl6BgaSFsnKWG3K\n6esgHlf0dKwKp0+2v+vcyvF5JOTg4hqTi2cx1i3D0TEcJcntEA2eBVogsNq4i1Fb\nZdX4UwULVMAJII/UvuwnxfnbS8H6oEkAF9bUvIh/B5skBowHrN6oMDt/0iJHUafv\ncNSdPJ5SSEsBMZFXZjtj4hy+Zfl1gyHMQm64db/YkN2/fOxWv++47AtL4pxINWC5\nGoPJPM3zKAlcu+IMr1IMmTvMXTrlBAbRZBn1amkI+VtZx+iL7An7hP3GBFpq3UVS\nsjJYm8Fx8IV/Hp3meJyTMvPvH0WJQjx/t8ZTNZ570s3+z7biD7jt4rAPqAitIIym\n54KE34xEVyihzUdP1R2Q\n=wy+E\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-16T12:57:32Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/railgrid/commit/b36b202eb952501b55c7a6ff318a8ca7176dfa59","node_id":"C_kwDORSHIc9oAKGIzNmIyMDJlYjk1MjUwMWI1NWM3YTZmZjMxOGE4Y2E3MTc2ZGZhNTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/railgrid/commit/bd33dcfe044953f9340636437dee1733fd86294f","sha":"bd33dcfe044953f9340636437dee1733fd86294f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/commits/bd33dcfe044953f9340636437dee1733fd86294f"}],"sha":"b36b202eb952501b55c7a6ff318a8ca7176dfa59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/commits/b36b202eb952501b55c7a6ff318a8ca7176dfa59"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3225744?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mjudeikis","id":3225744,"login":"mjudeikis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjU3NDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/commits/bd33dcfe044953f9340636437dee1733fd86294f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T11:11:41Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T11:11:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Remove deprecated CLI commands and always write endpoint slice export paths (#751)\n\n* Remove deprecated CLI spellings\n\nThe rename dropped the need for backwards compatibility, so remove the\nhidden pre-1.0 commands and fallbacks:\n- `railgrid get` and `railgrid apply` (use kubectl or `railgrid edge list`)\n- `railgrid kubeconfig edge` (use `railgrid edge kubeconfig`)\n- the hidden `railgrid list`/`ls` shorthand (use `railgrid edge list`)\n- `railgrid dev create --agent-count` (use `--worker-count`)\n- login treating a non-JSON /healthz as an old server with OIDC; it is\n  now an error\n- the unused SaveAgentConfig wrapper\n\nUpdate docs, skills, the edges portal, hub hints and e2e tests to the\ncurrent spellings.\n\n* Always write the export path on APIExportEndpointSlices\n\nA path-less slice is indexed only under its logical-cluster name, so a\nshard''s endpoint-URL publisher, which looks slices up by the binding''s\ncanonical export path, misses it and never publishes its virtual\nworkspace URL for the first binding on another shard. Resolve the\nworkspace path from the LogicalCluster when none is configured and\nalways write it; path-less slices from older SDKs are recreated once.\n\n* Use the install script in the portal CLI quickstart\n\n* Drop removed CLI spellings from the e2e suites\n\nThe CLI suite still expected the hidden ''railgrid ls'' and the edges\nconnectivity suite still called ''railgrid kubeconfig edge''.","tree":{"sha":"5fc4efc37982be7e4cde402adfce09d7fdbc2d68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/git/trees/5fc4efc37982be7e4cde402adfce09d7fdbc2d68"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/git/commits/bd33dcfe044953f9340636437dee1733fd86294f","verification":{"payload":"tree 5fc4efc37982be7e4cde402adfce09d7fdbc2d68\nparent ee8225f790609b268109caab0d3260b484c2ff0a\nauthor Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt> 1789557101 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789557101 +0300\n\nRemove deprecated CLI commands and always write endpoint slice export paths (#751)\n\n* Remove deprecated CLI spellings\n\nThe rename dropped the need for backwards compatibility, so remove the\nhidden pre-1.0 commands and fallbacks:\n- `railgrid get` and `railgrid apply` (use kubectl or `railgrid edge list`)\n- `railgrid kubeconfig edge` (use `railgrid edge kubeconfig`)\n- the hidden `railgrid list`/`ls` shorthand (use `railgrid edge list`)\n- `railgrid dev create --agent-count` (use `--worker-count`)\n- login treating a non-JSON /healthz as an old server with OIDC; it is\n  now an error\n- the unused SaveAgentConfig wrapper\n\nUpdate docs, skills, the edges portal, hub hints and e2e tests to the\ncurrent spellings.\n\n* Always write the export path on APIExportEndpointSlices\n\nA path-less slice is indexed only under its logical-cluster name, so a\nshard''s endpoint-URL publisher, which looks slices up by the binding''s\ncanonical export path, misses it and never publishes its virtual\nworkspace URL for the first binding on another shard. Resolve the\nworkspace path from the LogicalCluster when none is configured and\nalways write it; path-less slices from older SDKs are recreated once.\n\n* Use the install script in the portal CLI quickstart\n\n* Drop removed CLI spellings from the e2e suites\n\nThe CLI suite still expected the hidden ''railgrid ls'' and the edges\nconnectivity suite still called ''railgrid kubeconfig edge''.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqnluCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARn0QADPuw1IFmpiu2aFcO0wZPZcj\njGmNdemAhbZibuGoOu6ELLbnuI9q7Ay6C7SqpEQ8qZaHZPnowqBmvSZiefcLusib\nTIc/Mx/GPVE2/KukAqQIiq6UCEKm33iMPjnfRF+LGA