lgrid/commits/ee8225f790609b268109caab0d3260b484c2ff0a"}],"sha":"bd33dcfe044953f9340636437dee1733fd86294f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/commits/bd33dcfe044953f9340636437dee1733fd86294f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3225744?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mjudeikis","id":3225744,"login":"mjudeikis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjU3NDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/commits/ee8225f790609b268109caab0d3260b484c2ff0a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T10:23:09Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T10:23:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Bump kcp to v0.33.0 and kcp-operator to v0.10.0 (#750)\n\n* Bump kcp to v0.33.0 and kcp-operator to v0.10.0\n\nMove every Go module to kcp v0.33.0 (sdk, client-go, cli,\nvirtual-workspace-framework, apimachinery/v2 v2.33.0) and drop the\nmjudeikis/kcp fork replaces; the fork carried kcp#4280, which ships in\nv0.33.0.\n\nAdapt the infrastructure provider to two v0.33 API breaks:\n- CachedResource is renamed to ClusterCachedResource (kcp#4281)\n- APIExport storage.virtual.identityHash is removed (kcp#4326)\n\nPoint local setups at the releases: Tiltfile.cluster defaults to the\nv0.33.0 image, `railgrid dev create kcp` uses chart 0.16.6 with the\nv0.33.0 image, the Makefile kcp binary and apigen move to v0.33.0, the\nexternal install defaults to kcp-operator v0.10.0, and tilt-e2e checks\nout kcp v0.33.0.\n\n* Align kcp apimachinery replaces on v2.33.0 across modules\n\nprovider-sdk, app-studio and code still replaced apimachinery/v2 with\nv2.32.0, which conflicts with the root module in the CI go.work.","tree":{"sha":"1ee91d5398929ab6afbcc5ddbfa23de529fc4e17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/git/trees/1ee91d5398929ab6afbcc5ddbfa23de529fc4e17"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/git/commits/ee8225f790609b268109caab0d3260b484c2ff0a","verification":{"payload":"tree 1ee91d5398929ab6afbcc5ddbfa23de529fc4e17\nparent 0d805d9429c32339820e7771329b42c72f4f1b51\nauthor Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt> 1789554189 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789554189 +0300\n\nBump kcp to v0.33.0 and kcp-operator to v0.10.0 (#750)\n\n* Bump kcp to v0.33.0 and kcp-operator to v0.10.0\n\nMove every Go module to kcp v0.33.0 (sdk, client-go, cli,\nvirtual-workspace-framework, apimachinery/v2 v2.33.0) and drop the\nmjudeikis/kcp fork replaces; the fork carried kcp#4280, which ships in\nv0.33.0.\n\nAdapt the infrastructure provider to two v0.33 API breaks:\n- CachedResource is renamed to ClusterCachedResource (kcp#4281)\n- APIExport storage.virtual.identityHash is removed (kcp#4326)\n\nPoint local setups at the releases: Tiltfile.cluster defaults to the\nv0.33.0 image, `railgrid dev create kcp` uses chart 0.16.6 with the\nv0.33.0 image, the Makefile kcp binary and apigen move to v0.33.0, the\nexternal install defaults to kcp-operator v0.10.0, and tilt-e2e checks\nout kcp v0.33.0.\n\n* Align kcp apimachinery replaces on v2.33.0 across modules\n\nprovider-sdk, app-studio and code still replaced apimachinery/v2 with\nv2.32.0, which conflicts with the root module in the CI go.work.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqm4NCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHdoQAIm6Ggl0Yw+HxpDrdOkTWoqy\nrt79C06QS8iJjRqX4SoQY8Sw9fiIkUVU0D2AbAE9OaoH273yySUFV+gragdojKj4\nua1LED5cldfxIjkO+OobSkYNgIEe9XCyKp4ybrnx/TYamTtEYAkFb/Ehl23bFmwH\nZNWq72Axg6eYEE6FHz4CnPazVnpww00RrgiHK4VVilbfmJ432QnBfD/6tiaQ5Qbp\nC6apS5UtZCzzSPPw83VsjI+dPyXhjpFKCPsouwWbaEJw9LTW3BjjViaw6kgHF5yA\nXuVCQFK748FGoL1t9f/G0gd7Z+eeKa7SEKihLCibsejXTxCotnFYXrlmNKUPFdX2\nAyGucpMR0y7leU85eej+GYy4ToUD26Ig3J6aM4uICtu9aiFWWgjqEJ2c1FW+DmPD\n4hhGUW7tIlIRsyvOhRy83e968P7w25L+aZxwyyUxdceXIMm4J2YC1uWLFjnXHiHc\nWdH7K4GTKym7oe3vACh5hr1J2cbd1nTMSL6dSuf+6qOvZadahU34gjtlbyB3rolf\nl5QRujLM7BcXJJZlogJ9Ce8Nms6IihTOdOsRYqWceNM2LyykQm8FPrlGPGAaQz0c\n8ozfhjVIMrb6aFTWmOXjcp1HNOcXlI5Hj/rxq5uTdUWtLwf+GpA23QItUMxODYpu\noJSmGMVfUxJhLgycGsHX\n=SYm2\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-16T10:23:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/railgrid/commit/ee8225f790609b268109caab0d3260b484c2ff0a","node_id":"C_kwDORSHIc9oAKGVlODIyNWY3OTA2MDliMjY4MTA5Y2FhYjBkMzI2MGI0ODRjMmZmMGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/railgrid/commit/0d805d9429c32339820e7771329b42c72f4f1b51","sha":"0d805d9429c32339820e7771329b42c72f4f1b51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/commits/0d805d9429c32339820e7771329b42c72f4f1b51"}],"sha":"ee8225f790609b268109caab0d3260b484c2ff0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/commits/ee8225f790609b268109caab0d3260b484c2ff0a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3225744?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mjudeikis","id":3225744,"login":"mjudeikis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjU3NDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/commits/0d805d9429c32339820e7771329b42c72f4f1b51/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T09:38:37Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T09:38:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Point goreleaser blob upload at the railgrid R2 account (#749)\n\nThe v0.2.0 release failed at the blob step because the rename left the\nold Cloudflare account endpoint in place and pointed at a bucket named\nrailgrid, which does not exist. Releases now upload to the railgrid-cli\nbucket in the new account, which serves downloads.railgrid.ai.","tree":{"sha":"2b1be595c2b5297b242223a58f8b1fd2bb1b492f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/git/trees/2b1be595c2b5297b242223a58f8b1fd2bb1b492f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/git/commits/0d805d9429c32339820e7771329b42c72f4f1b51","verification":{"payload":"tree 2b1be595c2b5297b242223a58f8b1fd2bb1b492f\nparent c2eaebe49c291cd33edc3f36e350c3f8aeb019a7\nauthor Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt> 1789551517 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789551517 +0300\n\nPoint goreleaser blob upload at the railgrid R2 account (#749)\n\nThe v0.2.0 release failed at the blob step because the rename left the\nold Cloudflare account endpoint in place and pointed at a bucket named\nrailgrid, which does not exist. Releases now upload to the railgrid-cli\nbucket in the new account, which serves downloads.railgrid.ai.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqmOdCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAdQYQAGj9+ZPzymVGCYiPytPHZYQh\nSFSy6ft6yv40+BdmhWUYvG4eKHU+R36kswprEYXLlwxDWAbSPsoMoISXHoKeuHmz\nkj5JxmlnogeT276EqZDnnZ2kEmCS+xLD4N6NH1BEieOdLXAWx3uCQz2uTdW40KTh\nkxbA3bgs7e6LWOd3ji+vt9PSGTikUaSu/M+7ixJT46GaMDV3osOxGWWedR93OF/4\nRQgetNxFqu66Gs6SbXjc/jiKlMuGN1fF4fQcN9vYzPHFeZMHMFHs2CDLOcx0q+E9\n+5evR5FqVgfgL4Bvs2q/EC7lH3Tt8HWaUi2QjhIGAr4jT5LqmMdWwN2XiYm5MDba\nEUuk73Q1QD8cvTjV6PQ8WeBBozjkyoffz5DWRtuliuccxlVit3sooj6ITHzezohm\nRBiuXzpepmCWvM+BqTGktWDeijg+hOYS3Df3MzOwVBzYAzJnieXvgdhFbE/PGIqr\nX0UDv18A/DzB6ce8yltUPDihT2JANgR7y6kLdcg/FoJwLgiKFTHdXvHndXfxWXa3\nBi3eItsL5jwFKCf8EpFMs1C1w9iXH7Q8s6Ugu1vs1KLBDpqNfx0bAW7OPjI/dwA3\nPaB827IjkseFNKVyO5oumaIs4Vf4SgQkbrS+19AMRgJqtt3uPXfCcKgC8Qy+tDUW\n5MT46LlwbXokMZghqqrO\n=SCbX\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-16T09:38:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/railgrid/commit/0d805d9429c32339820e7771329b42c72f4f1b51","node_id":"C_kwDORSHIc9oAKDBkODA1ZDk0MjljMzIzMzk4MjBlNzc3MTMyOWI0MmM3MmY0ZjFiNTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/railgrid/commit/c2eaebe49c291cd33edc3f36e350c3f8aeb019a7","sha":"c2eaebe49c291cd33edc3f36e350c3f8aeb019a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/commits/c2eaebe49c291cd33edc3f36e350c3f8aeb019a7"}],"sha":"0d805d9429c32339820e7771329b42c72f4f1b51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/commits/0d805d9429c32339820e7771329b42c72f4f1b51"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3225744?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mjudeikis","id":3225744,"login":"mjudeikis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjU3NDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/commits/c2eaebe49c291cd33edc3f36e350c3f8aeb019a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T06:15:39Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T06:15:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[AUTOMATED BOT PR] feat: show your member ID and suggest users when adding members (#743)\n\n* feat: show users the member ID others add them with\n\nStatic-token users have no email (#741), so the portal showed them only\n\"Authenticated user\" and they had no way to learn what to give an admin\nwho wants to add them to an organization or workspace.\n\n- GET /api/users/me returns the caller''s user name, email, display name\n  and RBAC identity\n- portal account menu shows the member ID (email, or the RBAC identity\n  when there is none) with a copy button and a hint that others add you\n  with it; the CLI quickstart footer uses it too\n- the add-member input says it takes an email or member ID\n- railgrid whoami prints a Member ID line, and uses the hub identity for\n  User instead of the personal org name; hubs without the endpoint keep\n  the old output\n\n* feat: suggest users by email prefix in the add-member box\n\nGET /api/users/search?q=<prefix> suggests accounts whose email or display\nname starts with the query, for the portal''s add-member input.\n\nIt lets any signed-in person discover other accounts'' emails, so it is\nnarrow on purpose:\n- signed-in users only; delegated provider tokens get 403\n- q must be at least 5 characters; prefix match only, at most 5 results\n- per-user token bucket: burst of 10, then one request every 6 seconds,\n  429 with Retry-After past that; malformed queries are charged too\n- accounts without an email (static tokens), accounts being deleted and\n  the caller are never suggested\n\nThe portal debounces, reuses a complete answer for a prefix to filter\nlonger queries locally, and stops asking until Retry-After after a 429,\nso typing one address usually costs one request. The add-member input is\na combobox (arrow keys, Enter, Escape) and skips existing members.\n\nAlso drops the \"others add you with it\" hint from the account menu.\n\n* feat: find static-token users in the add-member search by member ID\n\nStatic-token users have no email, so the user search skipped them. They\nnow match on their member ID once the query carries at least 5 characters\nof the hash (\"railgrid:static:02d4b\" or \"static:02d4b\"); the shared\n\"railgrid:static:\" part alone still lists nobody. Email and display-name\nmatching is unchanged.\n\nSuggestions carry a memberId (the email, or the RBAC identity when there\nis none), which the portal shows and puts in the add box. The portal\nwaits for the same 5 hash characters and no longer reuses an answer for\na shorter plain prefix (e.g. \"railgrid\") to answer a static member-ID query,\nsince that answer excluded static-token accounts.","tree":{"sha":"46416f3fbc11a3a6edc4eacdeb89bf6c726f81e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/git/trees/46416f3fbc11a3a6edc4eacdeb89bf6c726f81e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/git/commits/c2eaebe49c291cd33edc3f36e350c3f8aeb019a7","verification":{"payload":"tree 46416f3fbc11a3a6edc4eacdeb89bf6c726f81e5\nparent f5b9adb15ca1b62d0e8068d016427f399ef209af\nauthor Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt> 1789539339 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789539339 +0300\n\n[AUTOMATED BOT PR] feat: show your member ID and suggest users when adding members (#743)\n\n* feat: show users the member ID others add them with\n\nStatic-token users have no email (#741), so the portal showed them only\n\"Authenticated user\" and they had no way to learn what to give an admin\nwho wants to add them to an organization or workspace.\n\n- GET /api/users/me returns the caller''s user name, email, display name\n  and RBAC identity\n- portal account menu shows the member ID (email, or the RBAC identity\n  when there is none) with a copy button and a hint that others add you\n  with it; the CLI quickstart footer uses it too\n- the add-member input says it takes an email or member ID\n- railgrid whoami prints a Member ID line, and uses the hub identity for\n  User instead of the personal org name; hubs without the endpoint keep\n  the old output\n\n* feat: suggest users by email prefix in the add-member box\n\nGET /api/users/search?q=<prefix> suggests accounts whose email or display\nname starts with the query, for the portal''s add-member input.\n\nIt lets any signed-in person discover other accounts'' emails, so it is\nnarrow on purpose:\n- signed-in users only; delegated provider tokens get 403\n- q must be at least 5 characters; prefix match only, at most 5 results\n- per-user token bucket: burst of 10, then one request every 6 seconds,\n  429 with Retry-After past that; malformed queries are charged too\n- accounts without an email (static tokens), accounts being deleted and\n  the caller are never suggested\n\nThe portal debounces, reuses a complete answer for a prefix to filter\nlonger queries locally, and stops asking until Retry-After after a 429,\nso typing one address usually costs one request. The add-member input is\na combobox (arrow keys, Enter, Escape) and skips existing members.\n\nAlso drops the \"others add you with it\" hint from the account menu.\n\n* feat: find static-token users in the add-member search by member ID\n\nStatic-token users have no email, so the user search skipped them. They\nnow match on their member ID once the query carries at least 5 characters\nof the hash (\"railgrid:static:02d4b\" or \"static:02d4b\"); the shared\n\"railgrid:static:\" part alone still lists nobody. Email and display-name\nmatching is unchanged.\n\nSuggestions carry a memberId (the email, or the RBAC identity when there\nis none), which the portal shows and puts in the add box. The portal\nwaits for the same 5 hash characters and no longer reuses an answer for\na shorter plain prefix (e.g. \"railgrid\") to answer a static member-ID query,\nsince that answer excluded static-token accounts.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqjQLCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKCcQAIKe/fP+Fzx/w1zp0MBQl67i\n9TPzZi1SnQsxB0qbnqRCbqavpPKN8vNok8+anfuVmCWidaXRQSeZE8X7E2uiHPvd\n5MrTwuez/3xj9hgGxmWuRv3g1u6UuSA/KLQm9mMaeUiOeihI61cZPhtQNZBq9W8T\n3dIjtLVulNMdpws4IHiayWoCKdntbge9ywxyLEcSD2/0oLrSazT2oEmsjW1gi8Wh\nJVnMNzJjpQHbca+ntNNtl06osLdeYdI6dQA1DCXooygMc8eXI+4omtvLZWG7ndEl\nxrbgEupffz7MzqRzYheOgK6+mEaGHOO0cOdlUbA5hYTyy1X6Jntr8H1OFaZEGzdG\nozYpMtIPJHL5Ci9hUE5uEuTHXYsHPbSi7M1G+464bWLg7noRJcc7gWZRgmFQzvC1\ngqyuRwYfJ626pw/yBBrz3ialZ3S8k5H02ZO0NI5V4hIBC1El0nQnvtWfO9WBA+3G\nznaYzy87433m4tDe4MiJWS/r7kIrPpbAS34wwvKIMh6jT8Q2EJYTFVNFuNpZZhpG\n4ovxXkpCVY3i/DkhyK5+XBfXusl+obqA1O/8GqbPDkAdvzqaZ33Ws06FdjdyryJY\nY9Y8xB8WM718DEQbCj0CkP/lA81DJSNhBdlVUJDOe8ke8yfl8eJhRa/xzMm9x2WZ\n/3VWKi41YOssr5fujwvy\n=sfDo\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-16T06:15:40Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/railgrid/commit/c2eaebe49c291cd33edc3f36e350c3f8aeb019a7","node_id":"C_kwDORSHIc9oAKGMyZWFlYmU0OWMyOTFjZDMzZWRjM2YzNmUzNTBjM2Y4YWViMDE5YTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/railgrid/commit/f5b9adb15ca1b62d0e8068d016427f399ef209af","sha":"f5b9adb15ca1b62d0e8068d016427f399ef209af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/commits/f5b9adb15ca1b62d0e8068d016427f399ef209af"}],"sha":"c2eaebe49c291cd33edc3f36e350c3f8aeb019a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/commits/c2eaebe49c291cd33edc3f36e350c3f8aeb019a7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/170962632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antcybersec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antcybersec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antcybersec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antcybersec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/antcybersec","id":170962632,"login":"antcybersec","node_id":"U_kgDOCjCuyA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antcybersec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antcybersec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antcybersec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antcybersec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antcybersec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/antcybersec","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/commits/f5b9adb15ca1b62d0e8068d016427f399ef209af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T05:01:51Z","email":"anant1234466@gmail.com","name":"anant"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T05:01:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: remove dead legacy kro broker client (#407) (#747)\n\nThe legacy kro broker client in providers/infrastructure/kro has no\ncallers repo-wide, and its constructor silently returns a stub backed by\nhardcoded sample templates whenever KRO_KUBECONFIG is unset - a trap if\nthe package were ever re-wired.\n\nDelete client.go, stub.go and schema.go outright, and trim instance.go,\nnamespace.go and templates.go down to the types, sentinel errors and\nlabel helpers that the package''s importers actually use. The live path\n(providers/infrastructure/backend/kro) is unaffected.\n\nschema.go and templates.go are not named in the issue but fall in the\nsame closure: every remaining function in templates.go is a realClient\nmethod, and ConvertSimpleSchema was reachable only from stub.go and\ntemplates.go.\n\nTwo namespace tests covered realClient.EnsureTenantNamespace and are\nremoved with it; TestRuntimeNamespace still covers the surviving helper.\n\nCo-authored-by: anant <170962632+antcybersec@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"7a40b30ba1a322a659d0fc953601d867f8897abe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/git/trees/7a40b30ba1a322a659d0fc953601d867f8897abe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/git/commits/f5b9adb15ca1b62d0e8068d016427f399ef209af","verification":{"payload":"tree 7a40b30ba1a322a659d0fc953601d867f8897abe\nparent cabd0fb9ae174290a86e5e463b52c678e9624471\nauthor anant <anant1234466@gmail.com> 1789534911 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789534911 +0300\n\nchore: remove dead legacy kro broker client (#407) (#747)\n\nThe legacy kro broker client in providers/infrastructure/kro has no\ncallers repo-wide, and its constructor silently returns a stub backed by\nhardcoded sample templates whenever KRO_KUBECONFIG is unset - a trap if\nthe package were ever re-wired.\n\nDelete client.go, stub.go and schema.go outright, and trim instance.go,\nnamespace.go and templates.go down to the types, sentinel errors and\nlabel helpers that the package''s importers actually use. The live path\n(providers/infrastructure/backend/kro) is unaffected.\n\nschema.go and templates.go are not named in the issue but fall in the\nsame closure: every remaining function in templates.go is a realClient\nmethod, and ConvertSimpleSchema was reachable only from stub.go and\ntemplates.go.\n\nTwo namespace tests covered realClient.EnsureTenantNamespace and are\nremoved with it; TestRuntimeNamespace still covers the surviving helper.\n\nCo-authored-by: anant <170962632+antcybersec@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqiK/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAATlMQAKoQ/s4Y6I4zaYsS+ePldZ59\nshDGOtfc0VmlBMxT23bmhCfUm3hgdQAar+z/RlDCyA6CqUWHhIaN5S1bRAFX945e\ntkqThI6mzM7/Rnm5iJqqUg4/hDS2KE65VoE1ladQ7Y7Q13OSsynOgjjypn+nSd6B\nSoh9zi8a7z4DjOUS6OxkDgjMsjbndv5XpwjirfJrhAfCvxArfYVPMRXTBQKPqZxh\nRu/2ONZds/aCgqXaTF/KZLOo22SQhXXNhLLNjN2dfcyyLBQzMd6k6TjPH4tnzE2e\n0o4bKrdKAt/bRphcjNrKZ8/ez5EIlH5L2dvkWC9EHL6hNMpbNpIaOx5D68XVv8Is\n1NFASA3ARGfGA65eN/t5x+wOfJt3gbpXGghR/s0GOBk+MHp2duQdlreofB6RiH3j\n7oYS8Yz5LYGXVBNR0blrN0MQrXaQ3CjtGd65sXfBYGQ71OBpQtPRexUCTi2nCp3T\nbjwz0kxFDYyYpj2RUgc/cmxLTR++DKrlOTPXzcGy64Fqqm9YAEwbl3hKlteD1VGl\nUuw0wKSe65jpqTWdaASEo4sTgmGEQDpjk/5LzH2AvqQtUeJCuIyG0Oy6nSvc+1yC\n5RcmtlGhyvga0sPt6fg1jRWyzUgF1twytOEtkzBdvqJoIL3LYsOBNRtrfGxM1BQs\ny+/uh6hAHQpNQDfZt2ll\n=vChy\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-16T05:01:52Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-f