pos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/railgrid/commit/f69ab870e82450df496603912e8564595df11c8e","node_id":"C_kwDORSHIc9oAKGY2OWFiODcwZTgyNDUwZGY0OTY2MDM5MTJlODU2NDU5NWRmMTFjOGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/railgrid/commit/d5052f6965f12cd5d3b48267d00fa4defc074b21","sha":"d5052f6965f12cd5d3b48267d00fa4defc074b21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/commits/d5052f6965f12cd5d3b48267d00fa4defc074b21"}],"sha":"f69ab870e82450df496603912e8564595df11c8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/commits/f69ab870e82450df496603912e8564595df11c8e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3225744?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mjudeikis","id":3225744,"login":"mjudeikis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjU3NDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/commits/d5052f6965f12cd5d3b48267d00fa4defc074b21/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T14:59:43Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T14:59:43Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Rename to railgrid (#744)\n\n* Rename to railgrid\n\n* Fix docs rendering\n\n* Fix ci issue\n\n* Rename faros paths inside base64-encoded Vite shims\n\nThe application and simple-webapp templates embed their Vite config shim\nas base64 in the dev start command, so the text rename missed the\nfile:///faros/bin/preview-bridge-plugin.mjs import inside it.\n\n* Point templates at renamed scaffold repos v0.1.4\n\nThe scaffold repos moved from railgrid/faros-scaffold-* to\nrailgrid/scaffold-*. v0.1.4 carries the faros -> railgrid rename, including\nthe .railgrid-vite.config.mjs gitignore entry, and publishes images under\nghcr.io/railgrid/scaffold-*.\n\n* Import kuery from github.com/railgrid/kuery\n\nrailgrid/kuery#8 renamed the kuery module path, so drop the last faroshq\nreferences and pin the kuery provider to the merge commit.","tree":{"sha":"3fdb722fd732c2bf28d947c7d2f184f0557680dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/git/trees/3fdb722fd732c2bf28d947c7d2f184f0557680dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/git/commits/d5052f6965f12cd5d3b48267d00fa4defc074b21","verification":{"payload":"tree 3fdb722fd732c2bf28d947c7d2f184f0557680dd\nparent 52c2152f110962831cf0a9375a6eb44bc4883039\nauthor Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt> 1789484383 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789484383 +0300\n\nRename to railgrid (#744)\n\n* Rename to railgrid\n\n* Fix docs rendering\n\n* Fix ci issue\n\n* Rename faros paths inside base64-encoded Vite shims\n\nThe application and simple-webapp templates embed their Vite config shim\nas base64 in the dev start command, so the text rename missed the\nfile:///faros/bin/preview-bridge-plugin.mjs import inside it.\n\n* Point templates at renamed scaffold repos v0.1.4\n\nThe scaffold repos moved from railgrid/faros-scaffold-* to\nrailgrid/scaffold-*. v0.1.4 carries the faros -> railgrid rename, including\nthe .railgrid-vite.config.mjs gitignore entry, and publishes images under\nghcr.io/railgrid/scaffold-*.\n\n* Import kuery from github.com/railgrid/kuery\n\nrailgrid/kuery#8 renamed the kuery module path, so drop the last faroshq\nreferences and pin the kuery provider to the merge commit.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqV1fCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHoIQAGH1eF1ocduUCfz04tybMvAB\n2o70Pu+e3bmGsXWubWoY5Gu8RxzOHwKLSnQLzVZL2UQtcLIFK5IeIz0kHcHenpNW\nOg7qfrmQrhlWabXTfyiFG/7tYe81q8DxJBtktfNhJrvmTtLKOi0OLRubzQ60nuLR\njmHsWKyaE9kcODaeYcd2pOS/5cvbl2DeJ4JYOGaQ1Ye+SPk3g36+fRnMGCYIW/t+\nymd3OU/PBmlkRyiDn2ZxiHei0w++ltvqOh0HOJ2txdJoZqvmgAC5vsyXbyijZicq\nI1gsiIK6AbE1Ay+zbYofnoNG1tMawi69DA+ifyFsMLyu/nKTe9bMxPH3UC6vlvFg\nKwHXDAOqglISzBRsbjySxtZW1PAcdZ755leJx07D3IQO67pfxtJF/tA+6/pU99bZ\nFqAerdMvli5YPi/x5wjocR1tGyU4YEdxAtU58FUyyQ31wLzuXxTNbTOuGdC7fgF4\nuBVKxaYohE9phOSAQ8/Vv84WEKAN22XigSMiB4p0IU5Ya8Rw35eH2rc/6w8xNM7e\nWHIRnPk1YFoYwm32BknVplH5yvStZLRoL6aewuhzm5HqShPSSSa3sU2pqIC2q/sV\naVNAPXzxXbj5e4CR0Kh278Bd0ZLILo0Q/CNf52SMSwCfz5b5MX5TzZGmx01jVm+B\nZmW4Viz1glOScgn4hxV5\n=1BXA\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-15T14:59:44Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://