445cfc6d4d053152d66cb99ee38e54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/commits/4cc30dc92a445cfc6d4d053152d66cb99ee38e54"}],"sha":"0af6d4076675904cd6031911cc97960d9c1321c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/commits/0af6d4076675904cd6031911cc97960d9c1321c1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3225744?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mjudeikis","id":3225744,"login":"mjudeikis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjU3NDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/commits/4cc30dc92a445cfc6d4d053152d66cb99ee38e54/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T18:52:09Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T18:52:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: full-stack faros dev init on sslip.io, MCP as the user, MCP-first skill (#734)\n\n- faros dev init: one kind cluster runs the hub plus edges, infrastructure,\n  code, agents and App Studio providers (own Postgres each), joins itself as\n  edge \"local\", publishes apps through Envoy Gateway on\n  *.apps.127.0.0.1.sslip.io:10443, and issues hub/apps certs from a stable\n  cert-manager dev CA exported as <cluster>-ca.crt. Works around the\n  infrastructure enable/readiness deadlock and pathless endpoint slices.\n- All local hubs move to https://console.127.0.0.1.sslip.io:9443 (Makefile\n  DEV_HUB_URL, Tiltfiles, dev scripts, Dex redirects, e2e); e2e runs dev init\n  hub-only.\n- faros-hub chart: kcp.embedded.shardURL defaults to the headless-Service DNS\n  name, so a hub pod restart no longer strands APIExport endpoint slices on\n  the old pod IP.\n- faros mcp proxy: stdio MCP server relaying the workspace aggregate with the\n  user''s own kubeconfig credentials (OIDC refresh, hub CA, org-owned\n  providers). faros mcp claude|codex register the token-based endpoint.\n- mcpaggregate: per-caller stale-while-revalidate cache of provider tools and\n  instructions, so tools/call no longer re-discovers every provider.\n- skills/faros: plugin registers faros mcp proxy; skill rewritten MCP-first\n  (fmcp helper, MCP column, infrastructure/agents playbooks), stale conflicts\n  resolved, live-verified tool facts.\n- docs/roadmap: audit telemetry proposal (not implemented).","tree":{"sha":"042190ab6bb81f6281123079cc81e7c326078094","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/git/trees/042190ab6bb81f6281123079cc81e7c326078094"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/git/commits/4cc30dc92a445cfc6d4d053152d66cb99ee38e54","verification":{"payload":"tree 042190ab6bb81f6281123079cc81e7c326078094\nparent 095eba3565aa7e82b5564b60e5909a8e3d898343\nauthor Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt> 1789325529 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789325529 +0300\n\nfeat: full-stack faros dev init on sslip.io, MCP as the user, MCP-first skill (#734)\n\n- faros dev init: one kind cluster runs the hub plus edges, infrastructure,\n  code, agents and App Studio providers (own Postgres each), joins itself as\n  edge \"local\", publishes apps through Envoy Gateway on\n  *.apps.127.0.0.1.sslip.io:10443, and issues hub/apps certs from a stable\n  cert-manager dev CA exported as <cluster>-ca.crt. Works around the\n  infrastructure enable/readiness deadlock and pathless endpoint slices.\n- All local hubs move to https://console.127.0.0.1.sslip.io:9443 (Makefile\n  DEV_HUB_URL, Tiltfiles, dev scripts, Dex redirects, e2e); e2e runs dev init\n  hub-only.\n- faros-hub chart: kcp.embedded.shardURL defaults to the headless-Service DNS\n  name, so a hub pod restart no longer strands APIExport endpoint slices on\n  the old pod IP.\n- faros mcp proxy: stdio MCP server relaying the workspace aggregate with the\n  user''s own kubeconfig credentials (OIDC refresh, hub CA, org-owned\n  providers). faros mcp claude|codex register the token-based endpoint.\n- mcpaggregate: per-caller stale-while-revalidate cache of provider tools and\n  instructions, so tools/call no longer re-discovers every provider.\n- skills/faros: plugin registers faros mcp proxy; skill rewritten MCP-first\n  (fmcp helper, MCP column, infrastructure/agents playbooks), stale conflicts\n  resolved, live-verified tool facts.\n- docs/roadmap: audit telemetry proposal (not implemented).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqpvDZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAY7wQAIZw7xhiwKGVVGbVqGZal0bM\nOG0uze0Yv2v7E5tUg9r6bJrAr1S4o260gSOQWeINw1/6KW3wQmup+QDhl3x7n8SZ\nuAdMd1gCHHblIxNJ5NkvkBAZ+bk5J057sxxJ1kb6TsXGeCgTVRR836KHshR5ue3x\n9M+A+XGLKBIof1GMkn9aKvExbZ2vcBsnRAZTRpYMsF8C9iluVn6aThQeg9Cac60I\n2irkiQ0E7JfgEWuh1NJSlPXLMbUPfySbjDtnPGaOeHyva4mNDEfyN1CFupWEQBzI\nwe967rZ14h6Y/Q4TVRRQ9JXUiUdVD9sFltF9jr8fToog9Kn07vcEEMKKBEE38+6D\nOo7rDuqZJdezsvWrYHkOwCK3PbIaHSajHrQQSPbI4jB8+TrFptyRhDGATuicWqwR\nvhpUNn6GqrAhWk6uwNYLpB2Qx9r2XTt84c5uguhjYdSGcszIZmuCv/clacpjdnbu\nSxjgj7wkF2IgLKrgCZdvVN6TrQAYCAbc/7xsIdRqojHe4V2GQ1tIkiwdi2Tz3n68\n7hzNOHMWklIcEeYcwTDmI3ZfPpL9BLXOWUaaDO5PdgRO+52FfJA4jkrh2sLE3bT5\nwRZllmmDcBUyKaTU11FNx65Dr8y4rwF0ADGOhdMPtL6+WXEfbUgEfXY186TGthZu\nOjgZQumVkciay1RJMIeu\n=8wPX\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-13T18:52