judeikis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjU3NDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/commits/095eba3565aa7e82b5564b60e5909a8e3d898343/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T17:48:45Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T17:48:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(portal): make the console light by default (#732)\n\nAn unset or unreadable theme preference now renders the light theme\ninstead of dark. index.html ships class=\"light\", and the pre-paint\nbootstrap and theme store fall back to light on storage errors, a\nmissing matchMedia, or a thrown error, so JavaScript-off and degraded\npaths match the default. An explicit light/dark/system choice is\nunchanged.\n\nThe toggle cycle becomes light -> dark -> system so the first click from\nthe default always changes what renders.\n\nThe design docs no longer describe dark as the default.","tree":{"sha":"937f14198118dc17baf51e389d1e4d5d7c3b6177","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/git/trees/937f14198118dc17baf51e389d1e4d5d7c3b6177"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/git/commits/095eba3565aa7e82b5564b60e5909a8e3d898343","verification":{"payload":"tree 937f14198118dc17baf51e389d1e4d5d7c3b6177\nparent 29eba33aed8d3942518e1b50535cd8ea419a14da\nauthor Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt> 1789321725 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789321725 +0300\n\nfeat(portal): make the console light by default (#732)\n\nAn unset or unreadable theme preference now renders the light theme\ninstead of dark. index.html ships class=\"light\", and the pre-paint\nbootstrap and theme store fall back to light on storage errors, a\nmissing matchMedia, or a thrown error, so JavaScript-off and degraded\npaths match the default. An explicit light/dark/system choice is\nunchanged.\n\nThe toggle cycle becomes light -> dark -> system so the first click from\nthe default always changes what renders.\n\nThe design docs no longer describe dark as the default.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqpuH9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAmWgQAGuh0O6C4OkXBxBYur0GiYrn\nzLxsIbFeanCzFtk2JM/CDnymwRf9VQ05TsXI4B3Z/G+JoWX6nTw2zI3IIxNfAZtp\nyUbf+JR4lDgHBY2VXo2/1bNSufo4mrbp1VM490s8wgH8pK3YHgZiszG2gkUuUKmg\nV6Z6h+Pzx2VgbF8UvTR3sWKOq+eMSt/6+72IHta9tPBuyFvuU5JrUaLpj0M1gcFh\n2B52mNBCm+D95MZTOy3TUKkl2APW2/LDesYh/xKnHF4v++5fg/HsecSlZ9fzPOuV\nrydfj5CY+iVJyWArZmLdeqliTAB+AKx/b0rE0/jYPeT5NTMA9OcYW9bSwS0eB2AH\nITt9BpIJQLEw34j+gJy/ivvGgEvK8dXrzK95wwNQzh74hQbsGjzMgpEWyPzQpt8f\nGczZIQ1Mu4z3VpRmsWGNBQRBfPvt75uElUN8nD8pDOl6+VQqHcL0yjsWkonPqrgG\nwuiTWIIcTk/0XZm3EB4eBJLg26tToQ594TPhJaQn+jDfQG8FUe3dLb5dCqp+37YI\nf9Fl6oF6mvxiXQ9HfWfcTSQtM8dggar3lTNa1ETWfJ4OxNxCjFDdjWKzW0jcrJsE\njVRzsQ8L07vocXIZ2etzhTSl6oHKrXjS/WLuHsTcn7Np/Hc6F98MGDhachIzgkgS\nLZRIXoJ5dKCiXzujG41O\n=nfdc\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-13T17:48:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users