ount":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T18:01:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci: stop deploying docs to GitHub Pages (#712)\n\nThe Jekyll build has failed on every push to main since the runner moved\nto Ruby 3.3 (liquid 4.0.3 calls String#tainted?, removed in Ruby 3.2).\nWe are not going to keep publishing docs/ as a Pages site, so drop the\nworkflow and the Jekyll-only scaffolding (Gemfile, _config.yml,\ndocker-compose.yml, _includes). Markdown content stays where it is.","tree":{"sha":"61faea6c5775c47a170906bdcf19cf9ffa05c480","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/git/trees/61faea6c5775c47a170906bdcf19cf9ffa05c480"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/railgrid/git/commits/60f3130c596cf5d2e725674376a8a145a254ae58","verification":{"payload":"tree 61faea6c5775c47a170906bdcf19cf9ffa05c480\nparent 372e6aa4ef51c073469bdbdfc3920e59d96305be\nauthor Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt> 1789236064 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789236064 +0300\n\nci: stop deploying docs to GitHub Pages (#712)\n\nThe Jekyll build has failed on every push to main since the runner moved\nto Ruby 3.3 (liquid 4.0.3 calls String#tainted?, removed in Ruby 3.2).\nWe are not going to keep publishing docs/ as a Pages site, so drop the\nworkflow and the Jekyll-only scaffolding (Gemfile, _config.yml,\ndocker-compose.yml, _includes). Markdown content stays where it is.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqpZNgCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAsg8QAKKZjCrOKKtMFofcGGoiuq7G\ncBsH713ucOAotxmmAW7txvZn+OyuZqAfc8fxRGaDhRkhTFJcnuuo0avQwG5EIxpi\ncE/2c8RMoeqG5zm7MTuPEiErhtEgjuwB7Cqwmlum4U1vFqp1A3QH5go2i8gilCiw\nE2BP2Hg5vWkGrQPDSRYQsIQmli+YIRgcPlpAVtrGPqB1sNGKezXeviwtp8rwa/x8\n+dwVT8WSErpcGtRSJuw9GMXxZusxypdkyf6zAJ+vhWbMRlX5r3ZmCoJ3KXc/M5uj\ngrcqUe4WTc2SLf6NNvqrnS3f/PGPmq/cc3Vm1+bzeAOxvtQKGgci4645rwC1BZ8y\natrnCBzpH/iVugiuFPUJZQ++OV3ditkjvl1fpmMgFO9cHJ5ZSUAf21E/g5bcoZ2X\nK3iOkPXnr8/+doW3eqqK+3vDA63BUWVgrI4BNuu0r8