b.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/emersonrrd-itsector/spec-driven-homebanking/commits/f96efacb2e80a72c55dad1e441b025bed261fcca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-17T16:07:44Z","email":"emerson.dias@itsector.pt","name":"Emerson Dias"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-17T16:07:44Z","email":"emerson.dias@itsector.pt","name":"Emerson Dias"},"message":"feat(T018): Toast Notifications System\n\n- Created ToastContext provider for managing toast notification state globally\n- Implemented useToast hook with three convenience methods: .success(), .error(), .info()\n- Created Toaster UI component that renders toasts in fixed top-right corner\n- Toast types: success (green), error (red), info (blue) with lucide-react icons\n- Auto-dismiss: All toasts automatically dismiss after 5 seconds (configurable)\n- Max 3 toasts: Enforces maximum 3 toasts on screen with FIFO queue (oldest removed)\n- Manual dismissal: Close button (X) on each toast for immediate dismissal\n- Integrated ToastProvider in App.tsx to wrap entire application\n- Integrated toast notifications in all pages:\n  - LoginPage: Success on login, error on auth failure\n  - DashboardPage: Error toast for account loading failures\n  - TransactionsPage: Error toast for transaction loading failures\n  - TransferPage: Success toast on transfer completion, error toast on failures\n- Toast styling: Dark theme compatible with Tailwind, smooth animations\n- Type-safe: Full TypeScript with proper interfaces for toast types and context\n- Unique IDs: Each toast gets unique ID for manual dismissal capability\n- Comprehensive test coverage: 20+ unit tests for context, hook, and component\n\nDoD Checklist:\n- [x] Context provider for toast notifications (ToastContext)\n- [x] Hook: useToast() with methods .success(message), .error(message), .info(message)\n- [x] shadcn/ui Toaster component renders toasts in UI\n- [x] Integrated in all API error responses (LoginPage, DashboardPage, TransactionsPage, TransferPage)\n- [x] Auto-dismiss after 5 seconds\n- [x] Maximum 3 toasts on screen at once\n- [x] committed\n\nCode Quality Gates:\n- npm run build: 0 errors ✓\n- npm run lint: 0 errors ✓\n- tsc --noEmit: 0 errors ✓\n- Unit tests: 20+ comprehensive test cases ✓\n\nFiles Created:\n- src/web/src/context/ToastContext.tsx\n- src/web/src/context/ToastContext.test.tsx\n- src/web/src/hooks/useToast.ts\n- src/web/src/hooks/useToast.test.tsx\n- src/web/src/components/ui/toaster.tsx\n- src/web/src/components/ui/toaster.test.tsx\n\nFiles Modified:\n- src/web/src/App.tsx (wrapped with ToastProvider)\n- src/web/src/pages/LoginPage.tsx (integrated toast)\n- src/web/src/pages/DashboardPage.tsx (integrated toast)\n- src/web/src/pages/TransactionsPage.tsx (integrated toast)\n- src/web/src/pages/TransferPage.tsx (integrated toast)\n\nPhase 2 Frontend Foundation Complete! ✓\n- T011: React + Vite Setup\n- T012: API Client Services\n- T013: Layout & Navigation\n- T014: Login Page\n- T015: Dashboard Page\n- T016: Transactions Page\n- T017: Transfer Form Page\n- T018: Toast Notifications\n\nReady for Phase 4: Testing (T019-T022)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a4faad3c9af26375ac581d605c494e8186cff97d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/emersonrrd-itsector/spec-driven-homebanking/git/trees/a4faad3c9af26375ac581d605c494e8186cff97d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/emersonrrd-itsector/spec-driven-homebanking/git/commits/f96efacb2e80a72c55dad1e441b025bed261fcca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuse