/abd2795a00d9b20bb16b14674c258ed4a505bf62"}],"sha":"bf576bc0324535680bc47d3a4fdc8a7b12f97602","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/emersonrrd-itsector/spec-driven-homebanking/commits/bf576bc0324535680bc47d3a4fdc8a7b12f97602"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188317267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/emersonrrd-itsector","id":188317267,"login":"emersonrrd-itsector","node_id":"U_kgDOCzl-Uw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/emersonrrd-itsector/spec-driven-homebanking/commits/abd2795a00d9b20bb16b14674c258ed4a505bf62/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-17T15:49:59Z","email":"emerson.dias@itsector.pt","name":"Emerson Dias"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-17T15:49:59Z","email":"emerson.dias@itsector.pt","name":"Emerson Dias"},"message":"feat(T016): Transactions Page with Table, Filters, and Pagination\n\n- Implemented full transactions page with account selector, transaction table, and filtering\n- Account selector dropdown: Populated from AccountsService.getAccounts(), shows name + balance\n- Transactions API integration: TransactionsService.getTransactions(accountId, skip, take, category)\n- Calls on mount and whenever account or filters change\n- shadcn/ui Table with 4 columns: Date (formatted), Description, Category (badge), Amount (formatted)\n- Category badges: 8 color-coded categories (Groceries=green, Utilities=blue, Food=orange, etc.)\n- Category filter dropdown: \"All Categories\" (default) + 8 predefined categories with on-change reload\n- Pagination: Previous/Next buttons with page boundaries, page size selector (10/25/50 default)\n- Shows: \"Showing X-Y of Z transactions\" and \"Page X of Y\" status\n- Loading state: 5-row skeleton table with animate-pulse, spinner, and \"Loading...\" text\n- Empty state: \"No transactions found\" message with suggestion to change filters or account\n- Error state: Error message with AlertCircle icon and Retry button\n- Dark theme: Complete Tailwind dark styling (slate-900, slate-800, etc.)\n- Responsive table: Proper spacing, horizontal scroll on mobile\n- Amount formatting: Intl.NumberFormat with USD locale, +/- sign based on type (green/red)\n- Date formatting: Intl.DateTimeFormat for readable date display\n- URL preservation: Uses searchParams to maintain accountId in query string\n- All controls disabled during loading\n\nComprehensive unit test suite (25 test cases):\n- Rendering tests (5 tests): Components, table structure, badges\n- Data loading tests (4 tests): Account and transaction loading, formatting\n- Filtering tests (3 tests): Account selection, category filter, default values\n- Pagination tests (6 tests): Next/previous navigation, page size changes, status\n- State management tests (7 tests): Loading, empty, error states, retry, controls\n\nDoD Checklist:\n- [x] Account selector dropdown (populated from accounts list)\n- [x] Calls getTransactions(accountId) on load and account change\n- [x] shadcn/ui Table with columns: Date, Description, Category, Amount\n- [x] Category badges (colored by category)\n- [x] Category filter selector (select from predefined categories)\n- [x] Pagination: prev/next buttons, page size selector (10/25/50)\n- [x] Loading state: table skeleton\n- [x] Empty state: \"No transactions\" message\n- [x] Dark theme ready\n- [x] Unit tests (render, filter, pagination)\n- [x] all tests pass\n\nCode Quality Gates:\n- npm run build: 0 errors ✓\n- npm run lint: 0 errors ✓\n- tsc --noEmit: 0 errors ✓\n- Unit tests: 25 comprehensive test cases ✓\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f22b7623537a69eebd52a9f7cdece528e6f67d63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/emersonrrd-itsector/spec-driven-homebanking/git/trees/f22b7623537a69eebd52a9f7cdece528e6f67d63"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/emersonrrd-itsector/spec-driven-homebanking/git/commits/abd2795a00d9b20bb16b14674c258ed4a505bf62","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188317267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/emersonrrd-itsector","id":188317267,"login":"emersonrrd-itsector","node_id":"U_kgDOCzl-Uw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https: