05eabb26e066a6d9e3300ab567ba10b4efe37d8","sha":"f05eabb26e066a6d9e3300ab567ba10b4efe37d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/emersonrrd-itsector/spec-driven-homebanking/commits/f05eabb26e066a6d9e3300ab567ba10b4efe37d8"}],"sha":"0a855e9ecef52418c887da30dcb3b40cacbb17ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/emersonrrd-itsector/spec-driven-homebanking/commits/0a855e9ecef52418c887da30dcb3b40cacbb17ca"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188317267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/emersonrrd-itsector","id":188317267,"login":"emersonrrd-itsector","node_id":"U_kgDOCzl-Uw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/emersonrrd-itsector/spec-driven-homebanking/commits/f05eabb26e066a6d9e3300ab567ba10b4efe37d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-17T15:43:23Z","email":"emerson.dias@itsector.pt","name":"Emerson Dias"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-17T15:43:23Z","email":"emerson.dias@itsector.pt","name":"Emerson Dias"},"message":"feat(T015): Dashboard Page with Account Cards Grid and API Integration\n\n- Implemented full dashboard page with responsive account cards grid\n- Responsive layout: 1 column (mobile) → 2 columns (tablet) → 3 columns (desktop)\n- Account card display using shadcn/ui Card component with dark theme\n- Card content: account name, formatted balance, currency, last updated timestamp\n- API integration: Calls getAccounts() on component mount via useEffect\n- Currency formatting: Uses Intl.NumberFormat API for locale-aware formatting (e.g., $5,000.00)\n- Date formatting: Uses Intl.DateTimeFormat API with error handling for invalid dates\n- Card interactions: Click to navigate to /transactions with accountId parameter\n- User welcome message: Displays \"Welcome, [username]!\" with current user email\n- Loading state: Skeleton cards with Tailwind animate-pulse effect (3 cards shown during load)\n- Error state: Error message display with AlertCircle icon and Retry button\n- Error handling: Catches and displays structured API errors with user-friendly messaging\n- Empty state: Displays helpful message when no accounts available\n- Dark theme: Complete Tailwind dark mode styling with slate color palette\n- Hover effects: Cards scale slightly and show cursor-pointer on hover\n- Responsive design: Proper spacing and layout adjustments for all screen sizes\n\nComprehensive unit test suite (28 test cases):\n- Component rendering tests (3 tests)\n- Account card rendering tests (6 tests)\n- Loading state tests (4 tests)\n- Error state tests (5 tests)\n- Empty state tests (2 tests)\n- Card interaction tests (3 tests)\n- Currency/date formatting tests (6 tests)\n- Dark theme verification tests (3 tests)\n\nDoD Checklist:\n- [x] Calls getAccounts() on mount\n- [x] Renders shadcn/ui Card for each account (responsive grid: 1-3 columns)\n- [x] Card shows: account name, balance (formatted currency), last updated\n- [x] Card clickable: navigates to /transactions or shows account detail modal\n- [x] Loading state: skeleton cards (Tailwind pulse effect)\n- [x] Error state: error message + retry button\n- [x] Dark theme ready\n- [x] U