n.dias@itsector.pt","name":"Emerson Dias"},"message":"feat(T005): Account Controller - Get Accounts & Balances\n\n- Implement GET /api/accounts endpoint returning user''s accounts with balance\n- Implement GET /api/accounts/{id} endpoint for single account detail\n- Create AccountService with business logic for account retrieval\n- Create response DTOs (AccountDto, AccountsResponse) with id, name, balance, currency, lastUpdated\n- Enforce JWT authorization on both endpoints with user isolation\n- Add 31 comprehensive unit tests (AccountsControllerTests: 17, AccountServiceTests: 14)\n- Add 47 additional tests to reach 85.21% code coverage (exceeds 80% requirement)\n- Configure ProducesResponseType attributes for Scalar OpenAPI documentation\n- All 172 tests passing, 0 build errors, 0 StyleCop warnings\n- User isolation verified: each user can only access their own accounts\n\nFixes: T005 Definition of Done\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5c629a16482f3571ba51eb4ca1c7ced337d4cbb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/emersonrrd-itsector/spec-driven-homebanking/git/trees/5c629a16482f3571ba51eb4ca1c7ced337d4cbb6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/emersonrrd-itsector/spec-driven-homebanking/git/commits/c89f6dd49bf2f63157d8f52e4a3cafcfda54ff64","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188317267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emersonrrd-itsector/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/emersonrrd-itsector","id":188317267,"login":"emersonrrd-itsector","node_id":"U_kgDOCzl-Uw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.co