low","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/esanmohammad/Micro-Frontend-API-caching/commit/f3ac0cf211f2e601868c0e1d6c25ec9236ce3229","node_id":"C_kwDORSL6JdoAKGYzYWMwY2YyMTFmMmU2MDE4NjhjMGUxZDZjMjVlYzkyMzZjZTMyMjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/esanmohammad/Micro-Frontend-API-caching/commit/3406d998da4ee2950163b9fa781ff30a88e2fd93","sha":"3406d998da4ee2950163b9fa781ff30a88e2fd93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/esanmohammad/Micro-Frontend-API-caching/commits/3406d998da4ee2950163b9fa781ff30a88e2fd93"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/esanmohammad/Micro-Frontend-API-caching/commit/98506229e33ebf24033106627506948da5dafb98","sha":"98506229e33ebf24033106627506948da5dafb98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/esanmohammad/Micro-Frontend-API-caching/commits/98506229e33ebf24033106627506948da5dafb98"}],"sha":"f3ac0cf211f2e601868c0e1d6c25ec9236ce3229","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/esanmohammad/Micro-Frontend-API-caching/commits/f3ac0cf211f2e601868c0e1d6c25ec9236ce3229"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117162150?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/esanmohammad","id":117162150,"login":"esanmohammad","node_id":"U_kgDOBvvApg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/esanmohammad/Micro-Frontend-API-caching/commits/98506229e33ebf24033106627506948da5dafb98/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-19T08:03:19Z","email":"esan.mohammad@sendinblue.com","name":"Esan Mohammad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-19T08:03:19Z","email":"esan.mohammad@sendinblue.com","name":"Esan Mohammad"},"message":"feat(dtsl-rtk-query): add config merging, base query routing, and divergence detection\n\nEliminate the \"first-registerer wins\" problem when multiple MFEs share\nthe same reducerPath. Previously, the first MFE''s config (baseQuery,\ntagTypes, mfeOptions) was silently locked in and all subsequent MFEs''\nconfig was discarded.\n\nNow:\n- tagTypes are merged via enhanceEndpoints({ addTagTypes })\n- baseQuery is routed per-endpoint via a new BaseQueryRouter, so MFEs\n  with different baseUrls can share the same reducerPath\n- mfeOptions are per-MFE (each MFE''s endpoints use their own enhanced\n  baseQuery with their own coalescing/tracking config)\n- keepUnusedDataFor divergence triggers a console.warn (only remaining\n  first-registerer-wins config)\n- MFE subscription is tracked via subscribe() on every registration\n\nNew files:\n- core/baseQueryRouter.ts — routes endpoint calls to the correct\n  underlying baseQuery based on endpoint name\n\nAlso adds a root README.md for the repository.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"349040e265b9b8265a1e8a6af45e7c6900129efe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/esanmohammad/Micro-Frontend-API-caching/git/trees/349040e265b9b8265a1e8a6af45e7c6900129efe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/esanmohammad/Micro-Frontend-API-caching/git/commits/98506229e33ebf24033106627506948da5dafb98","verification":{"payload":"tree 349040e265b9b8265a1e8a6af45e7c6900129efe\nparent c7665f3495c27b304733941b910511b04e12de79\nauthor Esan Mohammad <esan.mohammad@sendinblue.com> 1771488199 +0530\ncommitter Esan Mohammad <esan.mohammad@sendinblue.com> 1771488199 +0530\n\nfeat(dtsl-rtk-query): add config merging, base query routing, and divergence detection\n\nEliminate the \"first-registerer wins\" problem when multiple MFEs share\nthe same reducerPath. Previously, the first MFE''s config (baseQuery,\ntagTypes, mfeOptions) was silently locked in and all subsequent MFEs''\nconfig was discarded.\n\nNow:\n- tagTypes are merged via enhanceEndpoints({ addTagTypes })\n- baseQuery is routed per-endpoint via a new BaseQueryRouter, so MFEs\n  with different baseUrls can share the same reducerPath\n- mfeOptions are per-MFE (each MFE''s endpoints use their own enhanced\n  baseQuery with their own coalescing/tracking config)\n- keepUnusedDataFor divergence triggers a console.warn (only remaining\n  first-registerer-wins config)\n- MFE subscription is tracked via subscribe() on every registration\n\nNew files:\n- core/baseQueryRouter.ts — routes endpoint calls to the correct\n  underlying baseQuery based on endpoint name\n\nAlso adds a root README.md for the repository.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQA3PJr12+dDwNdm5CBzld5BA1TGgUCaZbDxwAKCRCBzld5BA1T\nGhT2AQCbBJlSGzrydF5DIyXqJ7slIUM22+nACqYz/08GTpN42QEA+KrrEECSHCUZ\ne93Fb3JPacsCi6jxODPUqKsbIOYQwgI=\n=zKXP\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-02-19T08:03:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117162150?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/esanmohammad","id":117162150,"login":"esanmohammad","node_id":"U_kgDOBvvApg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/esanmohammad/Micro-Frontend-API-caching/commit/98506229e33ebf24033106627506948da5dafb98","node_id":"C_kwDORSL6JdoAKDk4NTA2MjI5ZTMzZWJmMjQwMzMxMDY2Mjc1MDY5NDhkYTVkYWZiOTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/esanmohammad/Micro-Frontend-API-caching/commit/c7665f3495c27b304733941b910511b04e12de79","sha":"c7665f3495c27b304733941b910511b04e12de79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/esanmohammad/Micro-Frontend-API-caching/commits/c7665f3495c27b304733941b910511b04e12de79"}],"sha":"98506229e33ebf24033106627506948da5dafb98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/esanmohammad/Micro-Frontend-API-caching/commits/98506229e33ebf24033106627506948da5dafb98"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117162150?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/esanmohammad","id":117162150,"login":"esanmohammad","node_id":"U_kgDOBvvApg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/esanmohammad/Micro-Frontend-API-caching/commits/c7665f3495c27b304733941b910511b04e12de79/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-19T05:52:54Z","email":"esan.mohammad@sendinblue.com","name":"Esan Mohammad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-19T05:52:54Z","email":"esan.mohammad@sendinblue.com","name":"Esan Mohammad"},"message":"feat(demos): add cross-resource and tag-based invalidation demo apps\n\nAdd 6 new apps demonstrating two advanced @dtsl/rtk-query invalidation\npatterns as separate federated MFE apps (not a single combined app):\n\nCross-Resource Invalidation (ports 4006, 4008, 4009):\n- demo-cr-users: Users MFE with rename mutation; configures\n  urlInvalidationManager.invalidateOn() to link users → orders\n- demo-cr-orders: Orders MFE that refreshes automatically when users\n  are mutated, with no tags and no knowledge of users\n- demo-cross-resource: host that composes both MFEs side by side\n\nTag-Based Invalidation (ports 4007, 4010, 4011):\n- demo-tb-users: Users MFE with providesTags/invalidatesTags: [User]\n- demo-tb-orders: Orders MFE with providesTags/invalidatesTags: [Order]\n- demo-tag-based: host with \"Do Both\" button (invalidatesTags: [User, Order])\n\nEach MFE is a separate React app with its own Provider/store; cache\nsharing and cross-app invalidation work via window.__DTSL_RTK_QUERY_REGISTRY__.\n\nFix overrideExisting conflict: host APIs must not define getUsers, as\ncreateApi evaluates before lazy sub-MFEs load; injectEndpoints with\noverrideExisting:false would silently block sub-MFEs from registering\ntheir tagged versions, breaking tag-based invalidation entirely.\n\nAlso updates demo-host (port 4005) to show all three invalidation\npatterns in one view and bumps demo:dev concurrency from 10 to 15.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"79059e6724e0fc6060263685441b909ed3cdcea6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/esanmohammad/Micro-Frontend-API-caching/git/trees/79059e6724e0fc6060263685441b909ed3cdcea6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/esanmohammad/Micro-Frontend-API-caching/git/commits/c7665f3495c27b304733941b910511b04e12de79","verification":{"payload":"tree 79059e6724e0fc6060263685441b909ed3cdcea6\nparent 3406d998da4ee2950163b9fa781ff30a88e2fd93\nauthor Esan Mohammad <esan.mohammad@sendinblue.com> 1771480374 +0530\ncommitter Esan Mohammad <esan.mohammad@sendinblue.com> 1771480374 +0530\n\nfeat(demos): add cross-resource and tag-based invalidation demo apps\n\nAdd 6 new apps demonstrating two advanced @dtsl/rtk-query invalidation\npatterns as separate federated MFE apps (not a single combined app):\n\nCross-Resource Invalidation (ports 4006, 4008, 4009):\n- demo-cr-users: Users MFE with rename mutation; configures\n  urlInvalidationManager.invalidateOn() to link users → orders\n- demo-cr-orders: Orders MFE that refreshes automatically when users\n  are mutated, with no tags and no knowledge of users\n- demo-cross-resource: host that composes both MFEs side by side\n\nTag-Based Invalidation (ports 4007, 4010, 4011):\n- demo-tb-users: Users MFE with providesTags/invalidatesTags: [User]\n- demo-tb-orders: Orders MFE with providesTags/invalidatesTags: [Order]\n- demo-tag-based: host with \"Do Both\" button (invalidatesTags: [User, Order])\n\nEach MFE is a separate React app with its own Provider/store; cache\nsharing and cross-app invalidation work via window.__DTSL_RTK_QUERY_REGISTRY__.\n\nFix overrideExisting conflict: host APIs must not define getUsers, as\ncreateApi evaluates before lazy sub-MFEs load; injectEndpoints with\noverrideExisting:false would silently block sub-MFEs from registering\ntheir tagged versions, breaking tag-based invalidation entirely.\n\nAlso updates demo-host (port 4005) to show all three invalidation\npatterns in one view and bumps demo:dev concurrency from 10 to 15.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQA3PJr12+dDwNdm5CBzld5BA1TGgUCaZalNgAKCRCBzld5BA1T\nGn6OAQCacHXneM/+T6K9DdREH59+XQsAYsbOvznEJf7KrBS2/gD9F1WRj3+XggN2\n8MWhN5emmXa5xJZ1JD797k3tujLmVAs=\n=7Ipz\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-02-19T05:53:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117162150?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/esanmohammad","id":117162150,"login":"esanmohammad","node_id":"U_kgDOBvvApg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/esanmohammad","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/esanmohammad/Micro-Frontend-API-caching/commit/c7665f3495c27b304733941b910511b04e12de79","