 (#12)\n\n- Add Zod schema validation for auth config at load time\n- Enforce requireVerifiedEmail on all login/signup flows\n- Enforce signupMode (invite_only/open/closed) for magic-link and OAuth\n- Add method-level enabled flag check (isMethodEnabledToMount)\n- Add isTenantOwner field to TenantUserLink schema with migration\n- Add rate limiting to /refresh and /logout endpoints\n- Add global IP rate limiter to auth router\n- Optimize login: use user from findAuthIdentityWithUser, avoid redundant queries\n- Optimize refresh: combine user + tenant link in single query\n- Optimize OAuth callback: remove redundant findAuthIdentityByProvider call\n\nAll changes scoped to completed Phase 1 methods only (email_password, email_otp, magic_link, phone_sms_otp, oauth, mfa).\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"99e1cb230dda95f36a157549093ebe7b603794cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dev-1603/celestial-auth-portal/git/trees/99e1cb230dda95f36a157549093ebe7b603794cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dev-1603/celestial-auth-portal/git/commits/8fab2eda5cfebf0e1128555cfd051e08219ab5f7","verification":{"payload":"tree 99e1cb230dda95f36a157549093ebe7b603794cd\nparent 84a18a9aec0cc4181d6451ea5e4f5e85e327548f\nauthor Debjyoti Mohapatra <mohapatra.dev02@gmail.com> 1773013421 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773013421 +0530\n\nfeat: MVP auth robustness - config validation, security hardening, query optimization (#12)\n\n- Add Zod schema validation for auth config at load time\n- Enforce requireVerifiedEmail on all login/signup flows\n- Enforce signupMode (invite_only/open/closed) for magic-link and OAuth\n- Add method-level enabled flag check (isMethodEnabledToMount)\n- Add isTenantOwner field to TenantUserLink schema with migration\n- Add rate limiting to /refresh and /logout endpoints\n- Add global IP rate limiter to auth router\n- Optimize login: use user from findAuthIdentityWithUser, avoid redundant queries\n- Optimize refresh: combine user + tenant link in single query\n- Optimize OAuth callback: remove redundant findAuthIdentityByProvider call\n\nAll changes scoped to completed Phase 1 methods only (email_password, email_otp, magic_link, phone_sms_otp, oauth, mfa).\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJprgmtCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6p4QACXcjjmNC9/JMHx2n5dMkd3G\nOgWMZiqmBgEKYM/lh5herHrfyh48GIkipgS7/wrdxKRn3XbXPIYeVm0DN4Gydv31\noAd5msYUhifY1vKl9jZR3M5MW9ApkZQHqqSq9oIWU+FkFgVJdYeBRVXGFfzHVBKY\nZJInoR7f9QYKJddJGXqcIHL8geHpl+j1i583jGpUcSRSydXTI55IFa4cIlBkyKMr\n70mzV0DKuZcYnN5kMvWWPKTCmIHhjcdZ+lVDdF26dMSwsp6QxmJEPyu5x+zfwLtr\nSEd5JThF2uTy3urI6ZlKAxqwgDNdC7HWTlUeaKUqbepD9lgF1b1gkOjqiD+H6QcW\nPwXCHNGQDiURsGYKQm211we9tSir5/wbcajG0BaUmM/n8fmYJjtcx6DDoLbYHeKb\nV2zyapbidav+VKJkYP38RT1HQvSskROTkiGgclBuXkfvOKnswG/zPbZTXiqc/wZg\n/ee+ax7K39HGqrPP9w478/Tb5uQxxKJ7EwjyQfRvix5Cg7FKvM9k5J7Nu5sgKomu\nP0Mgt07wDVIWKcXvGHv0w+bC5r5R1D9yWtdd1C7TagBsLpSM/vzJH7O15PA/jAO6\nMS1MikpIFmgCGYGur2OyZ36/Gh2OoNf0CdOKf3zHbp1dGHCAvWH3vO5e5Z2+Ani3\nCikz30HxSKtZsITTTK0B\n=5WHK\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-08T23:43:42Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subs