86e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-08T16:03:07Z","email":"mohapatra.dev02@gmail.com","name":"Debjyoti Mohapatra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-08T16:03:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"🚀 feat: Magic Link Authentication + Seed Script + Migration Fixes (#5)\n\n* feat: Multi-method auth architecture - Phase 1 (DB schema, Email/Password, Email OTP)\n\n- Step 0: DB Schema\n  - Added AuthIdentity model for multi-provider auth support\n  - Added VerificationCode model for OTP and magic link tokens\n  - Added backfill script for migrating existing users\n  - Migration pending (requires DB connection)\n\n- Method 1: Email/Password (refined)\n  - Refactored to use AuthIdentity for user lookup\n  - Config-driven route mounting\n  - Updated tests (5 tests passing)\n\n- Method 2: Email OTP (complete E2E)\n  - OTP send handler with email integration\n  - OTP verify handler with JWT issuance\n  - VerificationCode repository\n  - All tests passing (18 tests)\n  - Swagger documentation\n  - Postman collection\n\n- Infrastructure\n  - Auth config loader (mirrors frontend auth.json)\n  - Email service abstraction (nodemailer/SendGrid/console)\n  - Config-driven method enable/disable\n  - Developer guide and setup documentation\n\n- Email Service\n  - Free SMTP support (Gmail, Outlook)\n  - SendGrid adapter ready for future use\n  - Console provider for development\n  - Comprehensive documentation\n\nFiles:\n- New: auth-identity.repository.ts, verification-code.repository.ts\n- New: email.service.ts, auth-config.loader.ts\n- New: otp-send.handler.ts, otp-verify.handler.ts\n- New: Documentation (DEVELOPER_GUIDE.md, EMAIL_SERVICE.md, etc.)\n- New: Postman collection, backfill script\n- Modified: login.handler.ts, routes.ts, schema.prisma, package.json\n\nCo-authored-by: mohapatra.dev02 <mohapatra.dev02@gmail.com>\n\n* docs: Add migration run guide clarifying local/server execution\n\nCo-authored-by: mohapatra.dev02 <mohapatra.dev02@gmail.com>\n\n* docs: Update migration guide with local execution details\n\nCo-authored-by: mohapatra.dev02 <mohapatra.dev02@gmail.com>\n\n* feat: Add database seed script for development and testing\n\n- Creates sample tenants (acme-corp, demo-company)\n- Creates roles (USER, ADMIN, OWNER)\n- Creates 4 test users with passwords\n- Creates AuthIdentity records for all users\n- Links users to tenants with role assignments\n- Idempotent (safe to run multiple times)\n- Includes seed guide documentation\n\nCo-authored-by: mohapatra.dev02 <mohapatra.dev02@gmail.com>\n\n* fix: Configure Prisma migrations to load .env.local via dotenv-cli\n\n- Updated db:migrate script to use dotenv-cli\n- Added dotenv-cli as dev dependency\n- Added ENV_FILE_SETUP.md guide explaining .env.local loading\n- Fixes DIRECT_URL not found error when using .env.local\n\nCo-authored-by: mohapatra.dev02 <mohapatra.dev02@gmail.com>\n\n* feat: Add Magic Link authentication method (Method 3)\n\n- Implement send magic link handler with secure token generation\n- Implement verify magic link handler with GET/POST support\n- Add config-driven route mounting for magic_link method\n- Add comprehensive unit tests (13 tests, all passing)\n- Add Swagger/OpenAPI documentation\n- Update Postman collection with Magic Link requests\n- Update Developer Guide with Method 3 documentation\n\nFeatures:\n- Secure 32-byte random token generation\n- Token hashing and storage in VerificationCode table\n- Email sending via email service abstraction\n- Support for browser redirect (GET) and API (POST) verification\n- Configurable expiry, signup allowance, and domain restrictions\n- Development mode returns magic link URL for testing\n\nCo-authored-by: mohapatra.dev02 <mohapatra.dev02@gmail.com>\n\n* security: Remove exposed secrets from ENV_FILE_SETUP.md\n\n- Replace actual Supabase project reference with [PROJECT_REF] placeholder\n- Replace actual password with [PASSWORD] placeholder\n- Add example with placeholder values instead of real credentials\n\nCo-authored-by: mohapatra.dev02 <mohapatra.dev02@gmail.com>\n\n* chore: Trigger GitGuardian rescan after security fix\n\nCo-authored-by: mohapatra.dev02 <mohapatra.dev02@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"95b6700fbfca46b9246ad6efc22a6874c594ac7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dev-1603/celestial-auth-portal/git/trees/95b6700fbfca46b9246ad6efc22a6874c594ac7a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dev-1603/celestial-auth-portal/git/commits/c5ff0f50e951fda641caf3239a64252c78fa86e1","verification":{"payload":"tree 95b6700fbfca46b9246ad6efc22a6874c594ac7a\nparent d0d6aac72e726c919b90eff40ae179abbf6aec6c\nauthor Debjyoti Mohapatra <mohapatra.dev02@gmail.com> 1772985787 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772985787 +0530\n\n🚀 feat: Magic Link Authentication + Seed Script + Migration Fixes (#5)\n\n* feat: Multi-method auth architecture - Phase 1 (DB schema, Email/Password, Email OTP)\n\n- Step 0: DB Schema\n  - Added AuthIdentity model for multi-provider auth support\n  - Added VerificationCode model for OTP and magic link tokens\n  - Added backfill script for migrating existing users\n  - Migration pending (requires DB connection)\n\n- Method 1: Email/Password (refined)\n  - Refactored to use AuthIdentity for user lookup\n  - Config-driven route mounting\n  - Updated tests (5 tests passing)\n\n- Method 2: Email OTP (complete E2E)\n  - OTP send handler with email integration\n  - OTP verify handler with JWT issuance\n  - VerificationCode repository\n  - All tests passing (18 tests)\n  - Swagger documentation\n  - Postman collection\n\n- Infrastructure\n  - Auth config loader (mirrors frontend auth.json)\n  - Email service abstraction (nodemailer/SendGrid/console)\n  - Config-driven method enable/disable\n  - Developer guide and setup documentation\n\n- Email Service\n  - Free SMTP support (Gmail, Outlook)\n  - SendGrid adapter ready for future use\n  - Console pr