6c1c8f459bb3f4e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T15:04:02Z","email":"cesulbaran@gmail.com","name":"Cesar A. Sulbaran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T15:04:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ISS-000): deploy to the CDN bucket CloudFront actually reads (#47)\n\nBoth distributions (E3A0H41AD1MAWR, E2Y0H0OSYO9FAU) already serve\ncdn-superpago-microfrontends-mx in mx-central-1, while this workflow still\nwrote to the Virginia bucket. The job went green and the browser kept getting\nthe previous bundle -- the deploy published where nobody reads.\n\nSame class of failure as doc-api, which synced to superpago-apidocs while the\nthree distributions had already moved to superpago-apidocs-mx.\n\nFound auditing all 52 repos: 21 of 22 mf-* workflows had it.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cesar Sulbaran <cesar.sulbaran@grupojar.com.mx>","tree":{"sha":"29b329020f43f4b882670ea2b848c97a00543673","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baatdigital/mf-sp/git/trees/29b329020f43f4b882670ea2b848c97a00543673"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baatdigital/mf-sp/git/commits/14fde04032cc9379bb54206d86c1c8f459bb3f4e","verification":{"payload":"tree 29b329020f43f4b882670ea2b848c97a00543673\nparent e6678e152dbe56e42505826bc32a94d3840de162\nauthor Cesar A. Sulbaran <cesulbaran@gmail.com> 1788275042 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788275042 -0600\n\nfix(ISS-000): deploy to the CDN bucket CloudFront actually reads (#47)\n\nBoth distributions (E3A0H41AD1MAWR, E2Y0H0OSYO9FAU) already serve\ncdn-superpago-microfrontends-mx in mx-central-1, while this workflow still\nwrote to the Virginia bucket. The job went green and the browser kept getting\nthe previous bundle -- the deploy published where nobody reads.\n\nSame class of failure as doc-api, which synced to superpago-apidocs while the\nthree distributions had already moved to superpago-apidocs-mx.\n\nFound auditing all 52 repos: 21 of 22 mf-* workflows had it.\n\nCo-authored-by: Ces