"received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/baatdigital/mf-sp/commit/c49b57c6eb36790f61ebdaee4a544426b4c9a34c","node_id":"C_kwDORSUhEdoAKGM0OWI1N2M2ZWIzNjc5MGY2MWViZGFlZTRhNTQ0NDI2YjRjOWEzNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/baatdigital/mf-sp/commit/4cc7d895df0f5ca616866863bebc98c2f6be5135","sha":"4cc7d895df0f5ca616866863bebc98c2f6be5135","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baatdigital/mf-sp/commits/4cc7d895df0f5ca616866863bebc98c2f6be5135"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/baatdigital/mf-sp/commit/4c18c08daaa219c06abcca97e9a0d6fabf5f6537","sha":"4c18c08daaa219c06abcca97e9a0d6fabf5f6537","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baatdigital/mf-sp/commits/4c18c08daaa219c06abcca97e9a0d6fabf5f6537"}],"sha":"c49b57c6eb36790f61ebdaee4a544426b4c9a34c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baatdigital/mf-sp/commits/c49b57c6eb36790f61ebdaee4a544426b4c9a34c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178029755?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cesargrupojar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cesargrupojar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cesargrupojar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cesargrupojar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cesargrupojar","id":178029755,"login":"cesargrupojar","node_id":"U_kgDOCpyEuw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cesargrupojar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cesargrupojar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cesargrupojar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cesargrupojar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cesargrupojar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cesargrupojar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baatdigital/mf-sp/commits/4c18c08daaa219c06abcca97e9a0d6fabf5f6537/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T18:35:36Z","email":"cesar.sulbaran@grupojar.com.mx","name":"Cesar Sulbaran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T18:35:36Z","email":"cesar.sulbaran@grupojar.com.mx","name":"Cesar Sulbaran"},"message":"fix(ISS-000): gate the main<->develop sync automation behind PROMOTION_ENABLED\n\nmf-sp is one of the 35 repos under Cesar''s 2026-08-04 GitHub Actions\nfreeze. Today''s incident on baatdigital/mf-invoicing (#797/#798) showed\nthat a promotion/sync workflow is active by default the instant it\nmerges: simply re-enabling Actions on a frozen repo (e.g. via the UI or\nAPI \"enable workflow\" action) was enough by itself to resume an\nunauthorized develop->main promotion, even though the content promoted\nwas already verified safe. The authorization bypass, not the content,\nwas the incident.\n\nAdd a job-level `if: vars.PROMOTION_ENABLED == ''true''` guard to\nback-merge-main-to-develop.yml''s back-merge job. The job had no prior\n`if:` condition, so this is the sole gate now. Until Cesar deliberately\ncreates the PROMOTION_ENABLED repo variable (not done by this commit),\nthe job -- including manual workflow_dispatch runs -- resolves to\nfalse and does nothing, regardless of whether Actions is enabled or\ndisabled at the repo level.\n\nAlso translated pre-existing Spanish comments/log strings in this file\nto English to satisfy the repo''s English-only code rule, enforced by\nthe posttooluse-english-only hook triggered while editing this file.\nNo logic changed.\n\nNote: mf-sp still has no forward develop->main promotion workflow at\nall (only this main->develop back-merge exists) -- that gap is\nunchanged and out of scope for this fix; it is a separate, bigger\ndecision.","tree":{"sha":"af0e939d2cfe5ff3ea874930554eddbf33ae1470","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baatdigital/mf-sp/git/trees/af0e939d2cfe5ff3ea874930554eddbf33ae1470"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baatdigital/mf-sp/git/commits/4c18c08daaa219c06abcca97e9a0d6fabf5f6537","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178029755?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cesargrupojar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cesargrupojar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cesargrupojar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cesargrupojar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cesargrupojar","id":178029755,"login":"cesargrupojar","node_id":"U_kgDOCpyEuw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cesargrupojar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cesargrupojar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cesargrupojar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cesargrupojar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cesargrupojar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cesargrupojar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/baatdigital/mf-sp/commit/4c18c08daaa219c06abcca97e9a0d6fabf5f6537","node_id":"C_kwDORSUhEdoAKDRjMThjMDhkYWFhMjE5YzA2YWJjY2E5N2U5YTBkNmZhYmY1ZjY1Mzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/baatdigital/mf-sp/commit/4cc7d895df0f5ca616866863bebc98c2f6be5135","sha":"4cc7d895df0f5ca616866863bebc98c2f6be5135","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baatdigital/mf-sp/commits/4cc7d895df0f5ca616866863bebc98c2f6be5135"}],"sha":"4c18c08daaa219c06abcca97e9a0d6fabf5f6537","url":"https: