url":"https://api.github.com/users/casp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/casp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/casp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baatdigital/mf-sp/commits/3274ba396feea278239c2471454909015b95384d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-18T18:29:40Z","email":"cesulbaran@gmail.com","name":"Cesar A Sulbaran P"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-18T18:29:40Z","email":"cesulbaran@gmail.com","name":"Cesar A Sulbaran P"},"message":"feat(ISS-000): EP-SP-007/008/011/012/013/020/025-030 mf-sp completo\n\nMicro-frontend SuperPago B2B/B2C con arquitectura multi-tier:\n\n- EP-SP-007: Scaffold Angular 21 + Native Federation (puerto 4210)\n- EP-SP-013: Shared components (AccountDetailCard, MovementsTable, etc.)\n- EP-SP-008: Portal Admin T1 (/sp/admin) - organizations, transfers, system\n- EP-SP-011: Portal Business T2 (/sp/business) - SPEI, accounts, reports\n- EP-SP-012: Portal Personal T3 (/sp/personal) - movimientos, send/receive\n- EP-SP-020: Cash screens (CashDashboard, CashIn, CashOut)\n- EP-SP-025: Admin Onboarding wizard 5 pasos + service-catalog\n- EP-SP-026: Admin BillPay conciliation dashboard + discrepancies\n- EP-SP-027: Business BillPay (pay-service, history, saved-services)\n- EP-SP-028: Personal Services (home, catalog, pay, history)\n- EP-SP-030: Notification config (admin SSE, business webhook, personal prefs)\n\nAngular 21, standalone components, signals, @if/@for, OnPush\n280+ tests, cobertura >= 98%\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c21aefc7249e5bae250e9c428c95c9773636c44e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baatdigital/mf-sp/git/trees/c21aefc7249e5bae250e9c428c95c9773636c44e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baatdigital/mf-sp