"redlexgilgamesh@gmail.com","name":"Redlex Gilgamesh"},"message":"Add Azure DevOps pipeline and consolidate test documentation\n\n- azure-pipelines.yml: 3-stage pipeline (UnitTests, Build, E2E) matching GitHub Actions\n- docs/TESTING_PATTERNS.md: Added Section 1 with all commands to run unit/E2E/lint\n  tests locally via Docker, plus Section 2 documenting both CI pipelines\n- docs/ARCHITECTURE.md: Added Section 6 referencing both CI platforms\n- AGENTS.md: Added Section 5 (CI/CD Pipelines) with sync rule\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d4c9c1b903203598ee96bbdaec44f70a89eac020","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/r3dlex/rib40-nextgen-shell/git/trees/d4c9c1b903203598ee96bbdaec44f70a89eac020"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/r3dlex/rib40-nextgen-shell/git/commits/b1cc4db82520303f4fe96817a378d9bfade7b62b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/r3dlex/rib40-nextgen-shell/commit/b1cc4db82520303f4fe96817a378d9bfade7b62b","node_id":"C_kwDORSjDldoAKGIxY2M0ZGI4MjUyMDMwM2Y0ZmU5NjgxN2EzNzhkOWJmYWRlN2I2MmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/r3dlex/rib40-nextgen-shell/commit/0206a75f33d8b2ebb01ee6d8bfbe6165acf6d268","sha":"0206a75f33d8b2ebb01ee6d8bfbe6165acf6d268","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/r3dlex/rib40-nextgen-shell/commits/0206a75f33d8b2ebb01ee6d8bfbe6165acf6d268"}],"sha":"b1cc4db82520303f4fe96817a378d9bfade7b62b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/r3dlex/rib40-nextgen-shell/commits/b1cc4db82520303f4fe96817a378d9bfade7b62b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/r3dlex/rib40-nextgen-shell/commits/0206a75f33d8b2ebb01ee6d8bfbe6165acf6d268/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-17T22:09:26Z","email":"redlexgilgamesh@gmail.com","name":"Redlex Gilgamesh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-17T22:09:26Z","email":"redlexgilgamesh@gmail.com","name":"Redlex Gilgamesh"}