\n- CI runs entirely in Docker (Zero-Install)\n- Playwright HTML report in artifacts/phase5/playwright-report/index.html\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b8b22393cbd4dd3486c7bd830bfb97e2eef59f72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/r3dlex/rib40-nextgen-shell/git/trees/b8b22393cbd4dd3486c7bd830bfb97e2eef59f72"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/r3dlex/rib40-nextgen-shell/git/commits/5033b6479b31dd5ab35d01baa248d10411a6629d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/r3dlex/rib40-nextgen-shell/commit/5033b6479b31dd5ab35d01baa248d10411a6629d","node_id":"C_kwDORSjDldoAKDUwMzNiNjQ3OWIzMWRkNWFiMzVkMDFiYWEyNDhkMTA0MTFhNjYyOWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/r3dlex/rib40-nextgen-shell/commit/b6198a9f056551bb207e3a8b3ac3e105591eba9d","sha":"b6198a9f056551bb207e3a8b3ac3e105591eba9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/r3dlex/rib40-nextgen-shell/commits/b6198a9f056551bb207e3a8b3ac3e105591eba9d"}],"sha":"5033b6479b31dd5ab35d01baa248d10411a6629d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/r3dlex/rib40-nextgen-shell/commits/5033b6479b31dd5ab35d01baa248d10411a6629d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/r3dlex/rib40-nextgen-shell/commits/b6198a9f056551bb207e3a8b3ac3e105591eba9d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-17T22:03:21Z","email":"redlexgilgamesh@gmail.com","name":"Redlex Gilgamesh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-17T22:03:21Z","email":"redlexgilgamesh@gmail.com","name":"Redlex Gilgamesh"},"message":"Phase 4: Federation & Gateway wiring with lazy-loaded remotes\n\n- Shell routes: /dashboard and /profile lazy-load via loadRemoteModule\n- Federation manifest routes through gateway (localhost:8080)\n- Nginx gateway proxies: / -> shell:4200, /dashboard -> dashboard:4201, /profile -> profile:4202\n- CORS headers on all responses (Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *)\n- All endpoin