y security scan on base images (trivy-scan.json)\n- Federation manifest updated for gateway-relative URLs\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5fd1bbf833d8d3c6a0da30bd087dfa7ebd3ef67d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/r3dlex/rib40-nextgen-shell/git/trees/5fd1bbf833d8d3c6a0da30bd087dfa7ebd3ef67d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/r3dlex/rib40-nextgen-shell/git/commits/6097dd58c3afd5fac64615ad422b3a18e8c7ca61","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/r3dlex/rib40-nextgen-shell/commit/6097dd58c3afd5fac64615ad422b3a18e8c7ca61","node_id":"C_kwDORSjDldoAKDYwOTdkZDU4YzNhZmQ1ZmFjNjQ2MTVhZDQyMmIzYTE4ZThjN2NhNjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/r3dlex/rib40-nextgen-shell/commit/05fe300e9b18f9cf20bf6aa2b9740c99c6fa74c1","sha":"05fe300e9b18f9cf20bf6aa2b9740c99c6fa74c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/r3dlex/rib40-nextgen-shell/commits/05fe300e9b18f9cf20bf6aa2b9740c99c6fa74c1"}],"sha":"6097dd58c3afd5fac64615ad422b3a18e8c7ca61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/r3dlex/rib40-nextgen-shell/commits/6097dd58c3afd5fac64615ad422b3a18e8c7ca61"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/r3dlex/rib40-nextgen-shell/commits/05fe300e9b18f9cf20bf6aa2b9740c99c6fa74c1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-17T21:49:35Z","email":"redlexgilgamesh@gmail.com","name":"Redlex Gilgamesh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-17T21:49:35Z","email":"redlexgilgamesh@gmail.com","name":"Redlex Gilgamesh"},"message":"Phase 1: Scaffold SOTA Nx workspace with Angular 21 + Native Federation\n\n- Nx 22.5.1 monorepo with 3 apps (rib40-shell, rib40-dashboard, rib40-profile)\n  and shared/ui signal-based library\n- Angular 21.1.0 with Zoneless change detection (provideZonelessChangeDetection)\n- Native Federation 21.1.1 (esbuild): shell as dynamic-host, remotes on ports 4201/4202\n- Vitest 4.x wired as unit t