url":"https://github.com/rdtect","id":31343717,"login":"rdtect","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMzQzNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rdtect/rdtect-os/commits/1bef7e56d7a5896dc00899c8fda3a25bf95c0244/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-30T10:15:32Z","email":"rdtect@users.noreply.github.com","name":"rdtect"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-30T10:15:32Z","email":"rdtect@users.noreply.github.com","name":"rdtect"},"message":"refactor(mrax-todo): plain-JS → Svelte 5 runes-class + MRAX file convention\n\nModernizes mrax-todo to be the cleanest reference of the MRAX trilogy in the\nmonorepo. Sister to mrax-tictactoe, but using full Svelte 5 runes (no \\$:,\nno createEventDispatcher, no legacy stores).\n\nClass-for-behaviour, functions-for-composing made literal:\n- TodoStore class: state with identity, $state + $derived, minimal\n  mutation API. The substrate.\n- todo.logic.ts: pure functions (createTodo, toggleStatus, rename, filter,\n  sort, getStats, isValidTodoText). The lens-builders. Reusable from any\n  TS context.\n- todo.handlers.ts: orchestrators — functions taking ctx + input, composing\n  pure logic + boundary effect + substrate mutation.\n- todo.effects.ts: IndexedDB sealed inside (Pattern-3 isolation per\n  pattern-libraries-at-the-boundary).\n- todo.types.ts: pure type definitions, no runtime.\n\nComponents (eXperience layer):\n- TodoApp.svelte: composition root. Wires ctx, calls handlers.\n- TodoForm / TodoItem / TodoFilters / TodoStats: each a fractal MRAX\n  micro-experience. Snippets-ready, runes-only, no event-dispatcher.\n\nThree universal invariants honoured:\n1. State immutable per tick (every mutation reassigns)\n2. Transitions pure functions (todo.logic.ts has zero side effects)\n3. Views derived ($derived for visible/stats/hasCompleted/isEmpty)\n\nThree-extension convention (Zen of Python at the filesystem):\n- .ts          → pure, framework-independent\n- .svelte.ts   → reactive substrate (uses runes)\n- .svelte      → eXperience surfaces (markup + reactive consumption)\n\nCode reduction: ~50% vs legacy. Renderer.js + EventHandler.js + manual\nrender() loop all gone — Svelte 5 runes replace them declaratively.\n\nLegacy preserved at labs/mrax-todo/_legacy/ for reference.\n\nARCHITECTURE.md added documenting MRAX mapping, anti-patterns avoided, and\ncross-links to the trilogy + Svelte alignment + libraries-at-boundary docs.\n\nsvelte-check: 370 files, 0 errors, 0 warnings.","tree":{"sha":"b154f7f354b7370ac318a4c5b6b162f217ff51dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rdtect/rdtect-os/git/trees/b154f7f354b7370ac318a4c5b6b162f217ff51dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rdtect/rdtect-os/git/commits/1bef7e56d7a5896dc00899c8fda3a25bf95c0244","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31343717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rdtect","id":31343717,"login":"rdtect","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMzQzNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"http