e host is unnecessary and causes conflicts\nwith existing services. Also adds HTTPS entrypoints + TLS for\nPocketBase and API routers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6512c4cdfd0f1bd387582a1fbe23937865b883f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rdtect/rdtect-os/git/trees/6512c4cdfd0f1bd387582a1fbe23937865b883f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rdtect/rdtect-os/git/commits/3295d5326731f9248d2f5cafdde0d30eb89f3d9d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31343717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rdtect","id":31343717,"login":"rdtect","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMzQzNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rdtect/rdtect-os/commit/3295d5326731f9248d2f5cafdde0d30eb89f3d9d","node_id":"C_kwDORSsZ19oAKDMyOTVkNTMyNjczMWY5MjQ4ZDJmNWNhZmRkZTBkMzBlYjg5ZjNkOWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rdtect/rdtect-os/commit/62157d62eab609ee376b6411266b22b5b9f9ccd3","sha":"62157d62eab609ee376b6411266b22b5b9f9ccd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rdtect/rdtect-os/commits/62157d62eab609ee376b6411266b22b5b9f9ccd3"}],"sha":"3295d5326731f9248d2f5cafdde0d30eb89f3d9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rdtect/rdtect-os/commits/3295d5326731f9248d2f5cafdde0d30eb89f3d9d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31343717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rdtect","id":31343717,"login":"rdtect","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMzQzNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rdtect/rdtect-os/commits/62157d62eab609ee376b6411266b22b5b9f9ccd3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-24T21:34:15Z","email":"ar.rickde@gmail.com","name":"rdtect"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-24T21:34:15Z","email":"ar.rickde@gmail.com","name":"rdtect"},"message":"feat: rdtect OS v2 — portfolio reframe with access tiers, design polish, and new plugins\n\nTransform rdtect OS into a creative coding portfolio at rdtect.com:\n\nCore System:\n- Add ''access'' field (free/protected) to all 21 plugin manifests\n- Create AuthGate glass-morphism login modal with email + GitHub OAuth\n- Add lock badges on taskbar icons for protected apps\n- Add system tray sign-in/user indicator\n\nDesign System:\n- Extend Tailwind tokens (9 colors, 6 font sizes, 4 border radii)\n- Clean CSS from 631→291 lines, remove 20+ dead animations\n- Add prefers-reduced-motion support\n- Simplify Desktop background (8→3 layers), reduce boot time (3.5→2s)\n- Add 44px touch targets and aria-labels to Window traffic lights\n- Unify Terminal, Code Editor, Notes plugin colors to desktop tokens\n\nNew Plugins:\n- Plugin Registry (App Store) — browse/search/launch all apps by category\n- Knowledge Base (Obsidian-like) — markdown, backlinks, tags, graph view\n- GitHub Globe — canvas-based rotating 3D globe\n- GitHub auto-sync in Project Gallery — fetches repos with caching\n\nDeploy Pipeline:\n- Switch to adapter-node for production\n- Fix Dockerfile for monorepo workspace resolution\n- Update docker-compose.prod.yml for rdtect.com with Traefik/Coolify labels\n- Create .dockerignore\n- Fix duplicate vite server configs in federation remotes\n- Remove broken symlinks from static/apps\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cb9b4036e661cbc881b343d65dc182c7a50b7a73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rdtect/rdtect-os/git/trees/cb9b4036e661cbc881b343d65dc182c7a50b7a73"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rdtect/rdtect-os/git/commits/62157d62eab609ee376b6411266b22b5b9f9ccd3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31343717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rdtect","id":31343717,"login":"rdtect","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMzQzNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rdtect/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rd