,"user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commits/ad2af2cf342880881240107d2d583ea7a306d372/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T12:07:55Z","email":"3273111+PradeepLoganathan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Pradeep Loganathan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T12:07:55Z","email":"3273111+PradeepLoganathan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Pradeep Loganathan"},"message":"feat: account balances + switcher, transfers (Pay), WhatsApp channel demo\n\nMajor demo enhancements across backend services and micro-apps:\n\nAccounts & statements\n- statement-service: balance endpoint + open/seed-demo; direction-aware\n  transactions (DEBIT/CREDIT) with salary + transfer credit lines; append-to-\n  current-month ledger primitive; per-account randomised seed data\n- home/statement-details/statement-analysis: read active account-id, show\n  balances + a primary account card, tappable account switcher, credits shown\n  in green, skip empty opening statements when resolving the latest\n- shell: ActiveAccountService + loader wiring + mbsb-select-account event\n- onboarding linked to a new account via AccountOpeningConsumer\n\nPay (transfers)\n- new payment-service: mock beneficiary catalog + transfer endpoint (debits\n  source, credits own-account destinations via statement-service)\n- new pay micro-app + Pay tab/route; onboarding moved off the tab bar to a\n  \"Open a new account\" CTA on Home with a back button\n\nWhatsApp channel demo\n- advisor: home_financing_i product + home-financing prompt; HomeFinancingLead\n  KVE + apply/get endpoints; Home banner reflects a lead raised on WhatsApp\n- vanilla-JS WhatsApp panel (docked beside the phone via ?whatsapp=1, plus a\n  standalone window) talking to the real advisor agent\n\nDemo chrome & ops\n- Akka-logo favicon; persona badge; larger phone frame\n- demo console: seed-statements card, WhatsApp link, payment-service health\n- run-local/stop-local/build/publish scripts updated for payment-service + pay\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9478c1013b135c065bdd4aa874949a6ebf720b71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/git/trees/9478c1013b135c065bdd4aa874949a6ebf720b71"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/git/commits/ad2af2cf342880881240107d2d583ea7a306d372","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3273111?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PradeepLoganathan","id":3273111,"login":"PradeepLoganathan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzMxMTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commit/ad2af2cf342880881240107d2d583ea7a306d372","node_id":"C_kwDORS1IRtoAKGFkMmFmMmNmMzQyODgwODgxMjQwMTA3ZDJkNTgzZWE3YTMwNmQzNzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commit/5f7baf3df834f45cbf170e81b0d624a8a2dc2a8e","sha":"5f7baf3df834f45cbf170e81b0d624a8a2dc2a8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commits/5f7baf3df834f45cbf170e81b0d624a8a2dc2a8e"}],"sha":"ad2af2cf342880881240107d2d583ea7a306d372","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commits/ad2af2cf342880881240107d2d583ea7a306d372"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3273111?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PradeepLoganathan","id":3273111,"login":"PradeepLoganathan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzMxMTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commits/5f7baf3df834f45cbf170e81b0d624a8a2dc2a8e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-01T04:17:16Z","email":"3273111+PradeepLoganathan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"pradeepl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-01T04:17:16Z","email":"3273111+PradeepLoganathan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"pradeepl"},"message":"feat(K7): structured advisor response + smart-link actions\n\nThe advisor now returns a closed-shape response with at most one ProposedAction,\nand the shell turns that action into navigation + form pre-fill. The customer\ngoes from \"can I afford a holiday in 2 years\" to a pre-filled Tabung form in\none tap — no free-form URLs from the LLM, no nav code in the micro-app.\n\nadvisor-service domain:\n- New AdvisorResponse(message, action, needsHuman) record + nested\n  ProposedAction(type, label, params). type is a String (with constants in\n  ProposedAction.Type) rather than a Java enum — Akka''s JSON Schema generation\n  for a nested enum field made some LLMs return the field as an object and\n  break Jackson parsing; a String + a documented closed set is more robust.\n  Type constants: CASA, TAKAFUL, TABUNG, ADVISOR_HUMAN, NONE.\n\nWealthAdvisorAgent:\n- ask() returns Effect<AdvisorResponse>; .responseConformsTo(AdvisorResponse.class)\n  forces structured output. .onFailure returns AdvisorResponse.handoff(...)\n  so a malformed model output degrades to the human-handoff bubble instead of\n  crashing.\n- System prompt rewritten with explicit MBSB-only guardrails (\"If asked about\n  non-MBSB products, other banks, crypto, politics... politely redirect\"),\n  the closed action enum, per-type params schema, and \"lead with secular\n  examples (holiday, emergency fund, house deposit, education); religious\n  savings only if the customer raises them first.\"\n- New goalsClient injected; getGoals now wired to goals-service (was stubbed).\n\nAdvisorEndpoint:\n- AskResponse + ActionView mirror the agent shape with the type stringified\n  for JSON friendliness; NONE / blank actions are normalised to null so the\n  client just renders ''if (action)''.\n\nadvisor micro-app:\n- Renders a single action button below the chat bubble when response.action\n  is non-null (yellow-accent border for ADVISOR_HUMAN, red-accent for product\n  actions, with merchant-appropriate icons).\n- Click dispatches CustomEvent(''mbsb-navigate'', { detail: { type, params },\n  bubbles: true, composed: true }) so the event escapes the Shadow DOM.\n- Tagline updated to \"Be Bold. Bank Smart.\" for brand consistency.\n\nbanking-shell AppComponent:\n- Listens for mbsb-navigate at the document level. Switches on detail.type:\n  TABUNG -> /app/home with openTabung/name/target/date query params\n  CASA / TAKAFUL -> /app/onboarding with product (and planId for takaful)\n  ADVISOR_HUMAN -> no nav (handoff already logged server-side)\n\nhome micro-app:\n- applyTabungQueryParams() on init reads ?openTabung=CATEGORY&name=...&target=...&date=...\n  pre-fills newGoal, and sets showAdd=true so the form is open and populated\n  the moment the customer lands on Home.\n\nTests:\n- 5 WealthAdvisorAgentTest cases covering each action type + the invalid-output\n  fallback. 4 AdvisorEndpointIntegrationTest cases covering the full HTTP path.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"19c4b6c0915f3ef2f29fc3bf134146090da31423","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/git/trees/19c4b6c0915f3ef2f29fc3bf134146090da31423"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/git/commits/5f7baf3df834f45cbf170e81b0d624a8a2dc2a8e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3273111?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PradeepLoganathan","id":3273111,"login":"PradeepLoganathan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzMxMTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commit/5f7baf3df834f45cbf170e81b0d624a8a2dc2a8e","node_id":"C_kwDORS1IRtoAKDVmN2JhZjNkZjgzNGY0NWNiZjE3MGU4MWIwZDYyNGE4YTJkYzJhOGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commit/af61ca61734d014efa797f6f2628d05da29de4f7","sha":"af61ca61734d014efa797f6f2628d05da29de4f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commits/af61ca61734d014efa797f6f2628d05da29de4f7"}],"sha":"5f7baf3df834f45cbf170e81b0d624a8a2dc2a8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commits/5f7baf3df834f45cbf170e81b0d624a8a2dc2a8e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3273111?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PradeepLoganathan","id":3273111,"login":"PradeepLoganathan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzMxMTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commits/af61ca61734d014efa797f6f2628d05da29de4f7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-01T04:16:17Z","email":"3273111+PradeepLoganathan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"pradeepl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-01T04:16:17Z","email":"3273111+PradeepLoganathan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"pradeepl"},"message":"feat(manifest): manifest-driven tabs + demo-console Show/Hide micro-app\n\nEarlier the shell''s tab bar was a static template — even if a micro-app entry\nwas removed from the manifest, its tab button stayed. This makes the tab bar\na function of the manifest, and adds the matching control in the demo console.\n\nbanking-shell:\n- TabsComponent rewritten with an ALL_TABS array (Home, Statements, Analysis,\n  Advisor, Onboard, Tips) each tagged with a microappName. On ngOnInit it\n  fetches the active manifest via MicroAppService and keeps only the tabs\n  whose micro-app is present. Falls back to ALL_TABS if the manifest can''t be\n  reached so the demo never goes empty.\n\ndemo-console:\n- New \"Micro-apps in this manifest — add / remove tabs live\" card with a\n  Hide / Show segment for the advisor entry (other entries can be added later\n  by reusing the same /api/tab plumbing).\n- server.js gains DEFAULT_ENTRIES (mirroring platform-service''s seedChannel)\n  and setTabPresence(name, present, persona): GETs the active persona''s\n  manifest, adds or removes the named entry, PUTs it back. /api/status also\n  now returns the list of present micro-app names so the segment auto-tracks\n  the live state.\n- /api/version response payload reflects active persona''s channel; the\n  v1/v2 toggle is already persona-aware after the previous commit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aa01bc5d0cfac9c1e6525d9a703a1ce2da53b1b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/git/trees/aa01bc5d0cfac9c1e6525d9a703a1ce2da53b1b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/git/commits/af61ca61734d014efa797f6f2628d05da29de4f7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3273111?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PradeepLoganathan","id":3273111,"login":"PradeepLoganathan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzMxMTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commit/af61ca61734d014efa797f6f2628d05da29de4f7","node_id":"C_kwDORS1IRtoAKGFmNjFjYTYxNzM0ZDAxNGVmYTc5N2Y2ZjI2MjhkMDVkYTI5ZGU0Zjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commit/52f99b812a6d007e39294363f2a6cb633c61bd2e","sha":"52f99b812a6d007e39294363f2a6cb633c61bd2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commits/52f99b812a6d007e39294363f2a6cb633c61bd2e"}],"sha":"af61ca61734d014efa797f6f2628d05da29de4f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commits/af61ca61734d014efa797f6f2628d05da29de4f7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3273111?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PradeepLoganathan","id":3273111,"login":"PradeepLoganathan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzMxMTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commits/52f99b812a6d007e39294363f2a6cb633c61bd2e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-01T04:16:03Z","email":"3273111+PradeepLoganathan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"pradeepl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-01T04:16:03Z","email":"3273111+PradeepLoganathan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"pradeepl"},"message":"feat(demo): MBSB tagline, statements layout fix, per-merchant NBA copy\n\nprelogin micro-app:\n- Hero subtitle changed from \"Islamic banking, reimagined.\" to \"Be Bold. Bank Smart.\" to\n  match the MBSB brand tagline used in the Next Gen App deck.\n\nstatement-details micro-app:\n- Statement card header was a single flex row (period + debits + count + chevron)\n  that overflowed on 360px-wide phones. Restructured as a 2-row CSS grid: period +\n  chevron on top, the meta line (debits + transactions) spanning row 2 with\n  flex-wrap. Reworded \"Debits: RM 1,234\" -> \"RM 1,234 debited\" so the amount\n  leads.\n- Transaction list was a 4-column <table> (Date / Merchant / Category / Amount)\n  that cut the amount off on phone widths. Replaced with a vertical row layout:\n  merchant (bold) + date · category below, amount pinned right with tabular\n  numerals — never wraps, never truncates.\n\nrecommendation-service NBA copy:\n- evaluateLargeTransaction extracted travelTakaful(amount, merchant) helper.\n  Hint sets per sub-type (AIRLINE_HINTS / HOTEL_HINTS / BOOKING_HINTS) drive\n  per-merchant phrasing:\n    AirAsia        -> \"Flying often? ... flight delays, lost baggage, medical abroad\"\n    Shangri-La KL  -> \"Staying away from home? ... stay cancellations, room theft, trip emergencies\"\n    Agoda          -> \"Planning a trip? ... protect end-to-end\"\n  Same productId (travel_takaful); only the reason text changes so the offer\n  reads like the merchant it was triggered by.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5e76f774da09ecfac5901cb463f3d93442fa1a3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/git/trees/5e76f774da09ecfac5901cb463f3d93442fa1a3f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/git/commits/52f99b812a6d007e39294363f2a6cb633c61bd2e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3273111?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PradeepLoganathan","id":3273111,"login":"PradeepLoganathan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzMxMTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commit/52f99b812a6d007e39294363f2a6cb633c61bd2e","node_id":"C_kwDORS1IRtoAKDUyZjk5YjgxMmE2ZDAwN2UzOTI5NDM2M2YyYTZjYjYzM2M2MWJkMmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commit/8c62a6d6ea84373eb62ef0c0abe2f0654d37f33d","sha":"8c62a6d6ea84373eb62ef0c0abe2f0654d37f33d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commits/8c62a6d6ea84373eb62ef0c0abe2f0654d37f33d"}],"sha":"52f99b812a6d007e39294363f2a6cb633c61bd2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commits/52f99b812a6d007e39294363f2a6cb633c61bd2e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3273111?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PradeepLoganathan","id":3273111,"login":"PradeepLoganathan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzMxMTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commits/8c62a6d6ea84373eb62ef0c0abe2f0654d37f33d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-01T04:15:44Z","email":"3273111+PradeepLoganathan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"pradeepl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-01T04:15:44Z","email":"3273111+PradeepLoganathan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"pradeepl"},"message":"feat(persona): inside-frame theming via shell-level CSS variables\n\nThe previous Move A wallpaper changes lived outside the device frame; this moves\nthe persona signal where the customer actually looks — the shell chrome inside\nthe phone.\n\nstyles.scss declares three brand variables at body level:\n  --mbsb-toolbar-bg, --mbsb-toolbar-fg, --mbsb-tab-active\nwith overrides per body[data-persona]:\n  digital-native -> vibrant purple (#6d28d9 / #7c3aed)\n  mass-affluent  -> deep navy + dark gold (#0a2540 + #f5deb3 / #b8860b)\ndefault keeps the existing #1a1a2e / #ffffff / #0f3460.\n\nEach tab component (home, statements, analysis, advisor, onboarding, recommendations)\nreplaces hard-coded ion-toolbar colours with var(--mbsb-toolbar-*). CSS variables\ninherit through Angular''s emulated view encapsulation, so a body-level value\nreaches every component without ::ng-deep or shadow piercing.\n\nTabs.component.ts already used --mbsb-tab-active (added in c1adf85); no change here.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fcb95ca0a9ae0072b1375095d78968be9f2729c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/git/trees/fcb95ca0a9ae0072b1375095d78968be9f2729c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/git/commits/8c62a6d6ea84373eb62ef0c0abe2f0654d37f33d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3273111?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PradeepLoganathan","id":3273111,"login":"PradeepLoganathan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzMxMTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commit/8c62a6d6ea84373eb62ef0c0abe2f0654d37f33d","node_id":"C_kwDORS1IRtoAKDhjNjJhNmQ2ZWE4NDM3M2ViNjJlZjBjMGFiZTJmMDY1NGQzN2YzM2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commit/c1adf853129c6b7208d3b5d540545724b8b33694","sha":"c1adf853129c6b7208d3b5d540545724b8b33694","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commits/c1adf853129c6b7208d3b5d540545724b8b33694"}],"sha":"8c62a6d6ea84373eb62ef0c0abe2f0654d37f33d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commits/8c62a6d6ea84373eb62ef0c0abe2f0654d37f33d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3273111?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PradeepLoganathan","id":3273111,"login":"PradeepLoganathan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzMxMTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commits/c1adf853129c6b7208d3b5d540545724b8b33694/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-01T03:17:03Z","email":"3273111+PradeepLoganathan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"pradeepl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-01T03:17:03Z","email":"3273111+PradeepLoganathan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"pradeepl"},"message":"feat(persona): manifest channel per customer persona (Move A)\n\nSame micro-frontend manifest mechanism that flips statement-analysis v1<->v2 now flips on a second axis: customer persona. The shell fetches a different channel per persona, and the demo console drives the active persona from a segment toggle.\n\nplatform-service:\n- ManifestEndpoint.seed() refactored into a seedChannel(channel, statementAnalysisVersion) helper and now seeds three channels:\n  - demo                       baseline / existing migrating customer (statement-analysis 1.0.0)\n  - demo-digital-native        reserved for future persona-specific variation (currently same as demo)\n  - demo-mass-affluent         statement-analysis pinned to 2.0.0 so Top Merchants is visible by default\n- ManifestEntity.create is already idempotent, so re-seeding is safe.\n\nbanking-shell:\n- New PersonaService resolves persona from a ?persona=<x> URL query param (wins), else localStorage, else default. Persists to localStorage so the choice survives navigation, and exposes channel() returning demo-<persona> (or demo for default).\n- MicroAppService no longer hardcodes the manifest URL — it builds it from PersonaService.channel() at fetch time.\n- AppComponent sets <body data-persona=\"...\"> on init so future per-persona CSS themes can hook in without touching components.\n\ndemo-console:\n- New \"Customer persona\" full-width card with a 3-button segment (Existing / Digital Native / Mass Affluent). Persists in the console''s own localStorage; the \"Open / refresh the banking app\" link now uses a named window target so an already-open banking-app tab gets navigated to the new ?persona=... URL instead of spawning a fresh tab.\n- /api/version is now persona-aware: the client sends {version, persona}, server resolves the channel from persona and rewrites that channel''s statement-analysis entry. Each persona''s version is independent.\n- /api/status accepts a ?persona= query param and reports the version of that channel, so the \"Current: vX\" badge always reflects the active persona''s view.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a99f7468bb0b21fdbbf4d5703a8491656a1816be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/git/trees/a99f7468bb0b21fdbbf4d5703a8491656a1816be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/git/commits/c1adf853129c6b7208d3b5d540545724b8b33694","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3273111?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/events{/privacy}"