ithub.com/PradeepLoganathan","id":3273111,"login":"PradeepLoganathan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzMxMTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commits/00bcf1b7ddfd303d3e166ee4763e6f6eeaba0f12/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-01T01:42:42Z","email":"3273111+PradeepLoganathan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"pradeepl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-01T01:42:42Z","email":"3273111+PradeepLoganathan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"pradeepl"},"message":"feat(accounts): surface CASA + Takaful on the home page\n\nA new \"Your accounts\" card on the home micro-app shows the customer''s CASA and Takaful applications, projected from the onboarding workflows by customerId. After Sara completes a CASA onboarding it appears at the top of her home without any cross-service event plumbing.\n\nonboarding-service:\n- CasaOnboardingsByCustomerView — @Consume.FromWorkflow(CasaOnboardingWorkflow) + onUpdate(CasaOnboarding) projecting an indexed row per application\n- TakafulOnboardingsByCustomerView — same pattern for the takaful workflow (distinct stages, policy number instead of account id)\n- OnboardingEndpoint adds GET /onboarding/customers/{customerId}/applications returning a unified Applications(List<AccountView>) sorted newest-first. AccountView is product-agnostic (CASA or TAKAFUL) with a friendly statusLabel mapped from raw workflow stages (\"AWAITING_EKYC_CONSENT\" -> \"Pending eKYC\", \"COMPLETED\" -> \"Ready to use\" / \"Active\", etc).\n- 3 new view integration tests + 2 new endpoint integration tests; all 14 onboarding tests green.\n\nhome micro-app:\n- Adds Application interface + accounts state + loadAccounts() called from loadAll()\n- Renders a \"Your accounts\" section between the hero and the NBA card, hidden when empty so first-time Sara sees nothing until she onboards\n- Status pill colour mapped via statusTier(): active (green) / pending (amber) / failed (red). CASA cards have a blue left-border + 🏦; Takaful cards have a teal left-border + 🛡️.\n- Adds onboardingApiUrl to environment.ts + environment.deployed.ts\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a6a80439e057e14bd25227b10e55bfd05f2c2357","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/git/trees/a6a80439e057e14bd25227b10e55bfd05f2c2357"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/git/commits/00bcf1b7ddfd303d3e166ee4763e6f6eeaba0f12","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3273111?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PradeepLoganathan","id":3273111,"login":"PradeepLoganathan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzMxMTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commit/00bcf1b7ddfd303d3e166ee4763e6f6eeaba0f12","node_id":"C_kwDORS1IRtoAKDAwYmNmMWI3ZGRmZDMwM2QzZTE2NmVlNDc2M2U2ZjZlZWFiYTBmMTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commit/b9288a46fe1d9969680ffc3f610cea027a2754cb","sha":"b9288a46fe1d9969680ffc3f610cea027a2754cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commits/b9288a46fe1d9969680ffc3f610cea027a2754cb"}],"sha":"00bcf1b7ddfd303d3e166ee4763e6f6eeaba0f12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commits/00bcf1b7ddfd303d3e166ee4763e6f6eeaba0f12"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3273111?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PradeepLoganathan","id":3273111,"login":"PradeepLoganathan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzMxMTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commits/b9288a46fe1d9969680ffc3f610cea027a2754cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-01T01:41:22Z","email":"3273111+PradeepLoganathan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"pradeepl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-01T01:41:22Z","email":"3273111+PradeepLoganathan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"pradeepl"},"message":"feat(demo): Malaysianise seed transactions, display amounts in RM\n\nstatement-service MockDataProvider:\n- All 45 transactions across 3 statements rewritten with Malaysian merchants — AirAsia, Malaysia Airlines, Firefly, Shangri-La / Pullman / Mandarin Oriental KL, Petronas, Shell, Tenaga Nasional, Air Selangor, Maxis / Celcom / Digi, Unifi, Aeon / Village Grocer / Lotus''s / Tesco / Cold Storage, Madam Kwan''s / Old Town White Coffee / Texas Chicken / Marini''s on 57, Pantai Hospital / Watsons / Guardian, Grab / RapidKL\n- Amounts scaled to plausible MYR (AirAsia round-trip KL-Bali RM 850, Shangri-La night RM 420, Tenaga monthly RM 100-300, etc.)\n- Monthly salary credit lifted to RM 9,500 so credit-vs-debit stays positive against MYR-scale spend\n- Category strings unchanged (analysis-service depends on the exact spellings)\n\nstatement-details + statement-analysis micro-apps:\n- Replace bare `| currency` (which defaulted to USD) with `| currency:''MYR'':''RM '':''1.2-2''` everywhere (debits line, transaction rows, totals, category amounts, top-merchant totals)\n- Bundles rebuilt and republished into platform-service resources\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bd7d4368317762c58eae1a71a70ad64a315c4882","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/git/trees/bd7d4368317762c58eae1a71a70ad64a315c4882"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/git/commits/b9288a46fe1d9969680ffc3f610cea027a2754cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.github