_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PradeepLoganathan","id":3273111,"login":"PradeepLoganathan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzMxMTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commits/605670399d034480ea0e6b12044f4f99973deb47/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-01T01:40:58Z","email":"3273111+PradeepLoganathan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"pradeepl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-01T01:40:58Z","email":"3273111+PradeepLoganathan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"pradeepl"},"message":"feat(K4): in-app home — tabungs, NBA card, manifest swap (frontend)\n\nmobile/microapps/home (new Angular Elements micro-app, tag <mf-home>):\n- Hero with greeting + month In/Out from statement\n- Tabungs section with progress bars, status pills, +RM 100 quick-contribute, inline \"+ Add\" form (name, category, target, date — stacked for narrow phone widths)\n- NBA \"moment for you\" card that auto-fires on the largest debit when home opens; tapping a transaction row re-fires with that row''s context (smooth scroll + flash pulse). A grey \"no offer right now\" card renders explicitly when the user tap returns matched:false, instead of going silent.\n- \"Tap a transaction\" rows showing top 3 large debits\n\nmobile/banking-shell:\n- HomeComponent swapped from a mocked balance/transaction view to a thin MicroAppLoader(\"home\") wrapper, matching the pattern used by RecommendationsComponent/AdvisorComponent\n\nplatform-service:\n- ManifestEndpoint seeds the \"home\" entry first in the demo channel manifest, mapped to /bundles/home/1.0.0/main.js\n- Pre-built bundle published into src/main/resources/www/home/1.0.0/main.js\n\nScripts:\n- build-microapps.sh + publish-microapps.sh add the home micro-app\n\nREADME:\n- Sara''s Day step 4 describes the Home (Tabungs + NBA moment-of-need card)\n- Services table adds goals-service :8089\n- API examples block adds goals + NBA curls\n- Project structure lists goals-service/ and mobile/microapps/home/\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a3cac4288b91720e2033c6e0880a283414fb0ea1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/git/trees/a3cac4288b91720e2033c6e0880a283414fb0ea1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/git/commits/605670399d034480ea0e6b12044f4f99973deb47","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3273111?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PradeepLoganathan","id":3273111,"login":"PradeepLoganathan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzMxMTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commit/605670399d034480ea0e6b12044f4f99973deb47","node_id":"C_kwDORS1IRtoAKDYwNTY3MDM5OWQwMzQ0ODBlYTBlNmIxMjA0NGY0Zjk5OTczZGViNDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commit/64370676e30e6c7f6743d47f138e01555619b16d","sha":"64370676e30e6c7f6743d47f138e01555619b16d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commits/64370676e30e6c7f6743d47f138e01555619b16d"}],"sha":"605670399d034480ea0e6b12044f4f99973deb47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commits/605670399d034480ea0e6b12044f4f99973deb47"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3273111?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PradeepLoganathan","id":3273111,"login":"PradeepLoganathan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzMxMTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commits/64370676e30e6c7f6743d47f138e01555619b16d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-01T01:18:20Z","email":"3273111+PradeepLoganathan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"pradeepl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-01T01:18:20Z","email":"3273111+PradeepLoganathan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"pradeepl"},"message":"feat(K4): tabung savings + NBA moment-of-need (backend)\n\ngoals-service (port 8089):\n- GoalEntity (ESE) with create/contribute/complete/abandon/get; contribute past target auto-emits GoalCompleted alongside ContributionMade\n- GoalsByCustomerView with byCustomer + activeByCustomer queries\n- GoalEndpoint exposing POST /customers/{id}/goals + POST /goals/{id}/{contribute,complete,abandon} + GET /goals/{id} + GET /customers/{id}/goals{,/active}\n- 15 tests (9 unit + 6 integration) green\n\nrecommendation-service NBA evaluator:\n- New POST /accounts/{id}/nba/evaluate route returning at most one offer for the moment context\n- Rules: LARGE_TRANSACTION_VIEWED over RM 350 + overseas -> multi-currency wallet; + travel hint -> travel takaful; SALARY_CREDIT_VIEWED over RM 5,000 -> tabung hajj autosave\n- Threshold tuned to 350 so AirAsia + Malaysia Airlines (both Travel) both surface the travel takaful offer; smaller debits return matched:false with a wrapped null offer\n- 10 new tests\n\nScripts:\n- run-local.sh + demo-console/server.js add goals-service:8089 to the service list\n- smoke-local.sh asserts goals + NBA endpoints; writes against a dedicated SMOKE_ACCT (smoke-test) so the demo customer''s tabungs list stays clean across restarts\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c2f1316764cbca242795989201f809752491087c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/git/trees/c2f1316764cbca242795989201f809752491087c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/git/commits/64370676e30e6c7f6743d47f138e01555619b16d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified