,"following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PradeepLoganathan","id":3273111,"login":"PradeepLoganathan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzMxMTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commits/5c5f5b2aef3cdd3de4c65080896aef16953f0804/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T16:09:35Z","email":"3273111+PradeepLoganathan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Pradeep Loganathan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T16:09:35Z","email":"3273111+PradeepLoganathan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Pradeep Loganathan"},"message":"feat(customer): K3 customer lifecycle + pre-login + welcome offer\n\nBackend (customer-service :8088): CustomerEntity (EventSourcedEntity) evolving one id through VISITOR -> REGISTERED -> CUSTOMER (createVisitor/register/completeKyc/get, stage guards, stubbed eKYC); WelcomeOfferRules computes a channel-keyed welcome offer on register (carried in the Registered event, accountId=acc-1001 to bridge to the rest of the app). CustomersByStageView projects by stage (String). CustomerEndpoint: visitor/register/kyc/get + /prelogin (tiles + live customer count). 8 tests (entity unit + view + endpoint integration).\n\nPre-login UI: prelogin micro-app (mf-prelogin) — visitor -> tiles -> register -> personalized welcome offer -> stubbed eKYC -> dispatches enter-app. Shell gated: app.routes restructured so the cold open is WelcomeComponent and the tabbed app moves under /app; WelcomeComponent hosts mf-prelogin and routes to /app/home on enter-app, with a Skip path. Manifest seed + build/publish scripts include prelogin.\n\nFixes/polish: shell color-scheme light (readable form inputs) + removed the device-frame Dynamic Island notch; demo console gains startup cues (amber ''starting'' state, progress bar + N/total + elapsed, ''All ready'' banner, reload-persistent) and seed-button result cues. Wiring: run/stop/smoke/demo-console include customer-service :8088. README + RUNNING-LOCALLY updated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"09fa97f4863e9dbfff3e814510a3e73e9cdbbbb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/git/trees/09fa97f4863e9dbfff3e814510a3e73e9cdbbbb8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/git/commits/5c5f5b2aef3cdd3de4c65080896aef16953f0804","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3273111?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PradeepLoganathan","id":3273111,"login":"PradeepLoganathan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzMxMTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/st