ain AffordabilityProjection), requestHumanHandoff. Structured AdvisorResponse (reply + proposal card + humanHandoffOffered); ''propose, never execute'' guardrail (no money-moving tool). AdvisorEndpoint POST /advisor/{customerId}/ask (session=customerId). Unit + endpoint integration tests via TestModelProvider.\n\nFrontend: advisor micro-app (Angular Element mf-advisor) — chat UI with proposal card + human-handoff; built and published to platform-service. banking-shell gains an Advisor tab (route + tab button + advisor.component). platform-service manifest seed includes the advisor micro-app.\n\nData/wiring: statement-service mock data adds a monthly income (totalCredits) so the savings surplus is positive and goals come out feasible. run-local/stop-local/smoke-local/demo-console + build/publish scripts include advisor-service and the advisor micro-app (publish CDN_DIR corrected to platform-service). README + docs/RUNNING-LOCALLY updated with the advisor port, endpoint, Advisor tab, and OPENAI_API_KEY note.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"220db54b78dd2a521ac9e8cad5f1b2546f980a87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/git/trees/220db54b78dd2a521ac9e8cad5f1b2546f980a87"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/git/commits/1f204503e317c8b78a6b109acc055a7ce785e145","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3273111?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PradeepLoganathan","id":3273111,"login":"Pra