eepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commits/d90add437f5711d839a2e70cc7da6a6f644fe0d0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3273111?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PradeepLoganathan","id":3273111,"login":"PradeepLoganathan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzMxMTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commits/07ec575685bf3bf45dcbe30c85feae2a78e821fa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T06:20:47Z","email":"3273111+PradeepLoganathan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Pradeep Loganathan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T06:20:47Z","email":"3273111+PradeepLoganathan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Pradeep Loganathan"},"message":"feat: add demo console + local runbook; stop-local also stops the UI\n\nscripts/demo-console/ + demo-console.sh: a dependency-free Node helper and web UI to start/stop the full stack, seed data, and flip the statement-analysis micro-app version (v1<->v2) from the browser — so demos need no terminal. All actions run server-side in the helper (no CORS; can manage processes).\n\ndocs/RUNNING-LOCALLY.md: runbook — service start order, run/seed/UI commands, live version switch, and troubleshooting.\n\nscripts/stop-local.sh: also free :4200 and kill ''ng serve'' so the UI stops too.\n\nmobile/banking-shell/angular.json: Angular CLI analytics opt-out (auto-added by ''ng serve'').\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e451a71ad505833a5269abc78df9146cb54ba69a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/git/trees/e451a71ad505833a5269abc78df9146cb54ba69a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/git/commits/07ec575685bf3bf45dcbe30c85feae2a78e821fa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3273111?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PradeepLoganathan","id":3273111,"login":"PradeepLoganathan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzMxMTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commit/07ec575685bf3bf45dcbe30c85feae2a78e821fa","node_id":"C_kwDORS1IRtoAKDA3ZWM1NzU2ODViZjNiZjQ1ZGNiZTMwYzg1ZmVhZTJhNzhlODIxZmE","paren