"3273111+PradeepLoganathan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Pradeep Loganathan"},"message":"chore: add local run/stop/smoke scripts and Warp launch config\n\nscripts/run-local.sh: background-start all 5 services (dependency order), wait for ports, seed, then verify. --clean for a fresh build. scripts/smoke-local.sh: wait + seed (idempotent) + curl every endpoint with PASS/FAIL. scripts/stop-local.sh: stop tracked PIDs and free the ports. scripts/warp/mbsb-local-services.yaml: Warp launch config that opens a live pane per service plus a seed+smoke tab.\n\nThese replace the stale run-all.sh/stop-all.sh path (which referenced the removed microfrontend-registry/microfrontend-cdn node servers; the platform is now a single Akka platform-service).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b146d744c1ebaacf0ded74c50bb5375a04f02b83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/git/trees/b146d744c1ebaacf0ded74c50bb5375a04f02b83"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/git/commits/4b24feae50f2f620874940cb64de9cfb75a56f43","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3273111?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PradeepLoganathan","id":3273111,"login":"PradeepLoganathan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzMxMTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/