":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/commits/f4918c798222d178a7466912d0048ac36de2b733/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-25T15:03:41Z","email":"3273111+PradeepLoganathan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Pradeep Loganathan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-25T15:03:41Z","email":"3273111+PradeepLoganathan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Pradeep Loganathan"},"message":"chore: add Akka deploy script (WIP) and RFI implementation plan\n\nscripts/deploy-akka.sh: repeatable build+deploy of the 5 backend services to the Akka platform — preflight (CLI/docker/auth/ACR helper), ensure project, per-service ''mvn install'' image build + ''akka service deploy --push'', wait-for-Ready, expose with CORS, seed. WIP: ACR image push (docker push to acr.europe-west1.akka.io) currently fails with exit 1 and still needs debugging. One-time ''akka auth container-registry configure'' is a prerequisite (now verified in preflight).\n\nRFI_IMPLEMENTATION.md: the MBSB ''Project NextGen'' demo build plan (K1-K5 + stretch).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"df091710065faba3e7310782b6ec7879d0f67fdd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/git/trees/df091710065faba3e7310782b6ec7879d0f67fdd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PradeepLoganathan/microsvs-microapp/git/commits/f4918c798222d178a7466912d0048ac36de2b733","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3273111?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PradeepLoganathan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","ht