"following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matebenyovszky","id":57362482,"login":"matebenyovszky","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MzYyNDgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/integrityauthority/superset-extensions/commits/ced26c47e22431a0246a6cd201f5bd3e9927cc3f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T15:30:57Z","email":"benyovszky.mate.work@outlook.com","name":"Benyovszky Máté"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T15:30:57Z","email":"benyovszky.mate.work@outlook.com","name":"Benyovszky Máté"},"message":"docs: add roadmap with open questions\n\nStructured so further extensions can be added: a cross-cutting section\nfor repo-wide concerns (version targets, build and release, upstream\ncontributions) and a per-extension section below it.\n\nCaptures the questions currently open on ai_assistant: tool duplication\nagainst superset.daos, the authorisation gaps found reviewing the SQL\npath, publishing our tools to MCP, and the work blocked on 6.2/7.0\nbuilds.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"47a9e6608b6b397198432690eec4ec60348097ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/integrityauthority/superset-extensions/git/trees/47a9e6608b6b397198432690eec4ec60348097ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/integrityauthority/superset-extensions/git/commits/ced26c47e22431a0246