\n- Updated tool list in system prompt and planner prompt\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"90e0940d61ca8ff808d960144e1e4cb837638f9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/integrityauthority/superset-extensions/git/trees/90e0940d61ca8ff808d960144e1e4cb837638f9f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/integrityauthority/superset-extensions/git/commits/0ff48959c2c7eb66a2e9771fb89983e976f70e54","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57362482?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matebenyovszky","id":57362482,"login":"matebenyovszky","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MzYyNDgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/integrityauthority/superset-extensions/commit/0ff48959c2c7eb66a2e9771fb89983e976f70e54","node_id":"C_kwDORS9wbtoAKDBmZjQ4OTU5YzJjN2ViNjZhMmU5NzcxZmI4OTk4M2U5NzZmNzBlNTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/integrityauthority/superset-extensions/commit/a19f89819bb16c968a98219a27318dbc35494c81","sha":"a19f89819bb16c968a98219a27318dbc35494c81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/integrityauthority/superset-extensions/commits/a19f89819bb16c968a98219a27318dbc35494c81"}],"sha":"0ff48959c2c7eb66a2e9771fb89983e976f70e54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/integrityauthority/superset-extensions/commits/0ff48959c2c7eb66a2e9771fb89983e976f70e54"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57362482?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matebenyovszky","id":57362482,"login":"matebenyovszky","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MzYyNDgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/integrityauthority/superset-extensions/commits/a19f89819bb16c968a98219a27318dbc35494c81/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-05T20:59:10Z","email":"benyovszky.mate.work@outlook.com","name":"Benyovszky Máté"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-05T20:59:10Z","email":"benyovszky.mate.work@outlook.com","name":"Benyovszky Máté"},"message":"fix: v0.4.2 - planner prompt tuning (goal-first, budget-aware, less obsessive checker)\n\nPlanner was spending all 15 steps on preparatory work (finding a company)\nand never reaching the actual user goal (creating charts/dashboard).\n\nChanges:\n- PLAN_SYSTEM_PROMPT: explicit budget allocation (20% explore, 30% SQL,\n  50% delivery), compact exploration, fallback-in-same-step rule\n- CHECK_SYSTEM_PROMPT: bias toward [] (no changes), accept partial results,\n  max 2 new steps per check, never re-plan succeeded steps\n- Step system prompt: enforce get_table_columns before SQL, max 2 retries\n  on 0-row queries, don''t repeat same query\n- Per-step round limit: 15 -> 8 (prevents looping on same query)\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"6fa650564cd0476aefc7b85624589bdf1da49c89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/integrityauthority/superset-extensions/git/trees/6fa650564cd0476aefc7b85624589bdf1da49c89"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/integrityauthority/superset-extensions/git/commits/a19f89819bb16c968a98219a27318dbc35494c81","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57362482?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matebenyovszky","id":57362482,"login":"matebenyovszky","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MzYyNDgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/integrityauthority/superset-extensions/commit/a19f89819bb16c968a98219a27318dbc35494c81","node_id":"C_kwDORS9wbtoAKGExOWY