et, step_id types)\n\n- Fix %d format error when checker returns string step_ids like \"5b\"\n- Clear todoItems on new message send (prevents stale todo from previous plan)\n- Normalize checker step_ids to integers in apply_plan_updates\n- Add explicit \"use integer step_id\" instruction to checker prompt\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"89a66dae89438d4e17741cc701da30cb1181dee9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/integrityauthority/superset-extensions/git/trees/89a66dae89438d4e17741cc701da30cb1181dee9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/integrityauthority/superset-extensions/git/commits/54b9a1edd12e80d03bf89113d4ba8b22e56ba0cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57362482?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matebenyovszky","id":57362482,"login":"matebenyovszky","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MzYyNDgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/integrityauthority/superset-extensions/commit/54b9a1edd12e80d03bf89113d4ba8b22e56ba0cb","node_id":"C_kwDORS9wbtoAKDU0YjlhMWVkZDEyZTgwZDAzYmY4OTExM2Q0YmE4YjIyZTU2YmEwY2I","p