anner that breaks complex user requests\ninto structured steps, executes each with full tool access, validates\nresults via a checker LLM, and re-plans when results are empty or wrong.\n\nNew files:\n- planner.py: plan creation, step checking, plan updates, data structures\n\nModified:\n- agent.py: dispatch to planner or simple stream, step-scoped execution\n- config.py: enable_planner, planner_max_steps (configurable), max_retries\n- tools.py: is_empty flag on execute_sql results\n- ChatPanel.tsx: template literal fix for TS type inference\n- READMEs: planner docs, architecture diagram, config reference\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"36395d4042f99bf1a85a7c7783b5855604abfacc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/integrityauthority/superset-extensions/git/trees/36395d4042f99bf1a85a7c7783b5855604abfacc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/integrityauthority/superset-extensions/git/commits/766e4157c0a7718174d35e003791d341f0dd375f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57362482?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matebenyovszky","id":57362482,"login":"matebenyovszky","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MzYyNDgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matebenyovszky/subscr