thubusercontent.com/u/1104680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gman0/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gman0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gman0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gman0/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gman0","id":1104680,"login":"gman0","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDQ2ODA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gman0/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gman0/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gman0/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gman0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gman0/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gman0","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/kbind-provider/commits/e3c51c8662bb2972da79fe8a373a252e1cd1407d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T09:35:02Z","email":"rvasek01@gmail.com","name":"Robert Vasek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T09:35:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"rework for kbind v2 (#124)\n\nReplace the kube-bind v1 backend with a lean kbind v2 bundle-style workflow.\nThe provider now manages ConnectedCluster objects that record consumer bundles\nand track konnector heartbeats via Lease. On the consumer side, the user generates\na kbind bundle (Secret + Connection + optional ClusterBinding) from the portal\nand applies it with kubectl. No backend server required. API group renamed to\nkbind-provider.platform-mesh.io.\n\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP robert.vasek@sap.com\n\nSigned-off-by: Robert Vasek <rvasek01@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"f9c2093c418143bc322c0aea18217be0c89e6e5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/kbind-provider/git/trees/f9c2093c418143bc322c0aea18217be0c89e6e5a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/kbind-provider/git/commits/e3c51c8662bb2972da79fe8a373a252e1cd1407d","verification":{"payload":"tree f9c2093c418143bc322c0aea18217be0c89e6e5a\nparent d91a4f6a86a1e0f83008667cc9069c17d1238c31\nauthor Robert Vasek <rvasek01@gmail.com> 1786095302 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786095302 +0300\n\nrework for kbind v2 (#124)\n\nReplace the kube-bind v1 backend with a lean kbind v2 bundle-style workflow.\nThe provider now manages ConnectedCluster objects that record consumer bundles\nand track konnector heartbeats via Lease. On the consumer side, the user generates\na kbind bundle (Secret + Connection + optional ClusterBinding) from the portal\nand applies it with kubectl. No backend server required. API group renamed to\nkbind-provider.platform-mesh.io.\n\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP robert.vasek@sap.com\n\nSigned-off-by: Robert Vasek <rvasek01@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqdabGCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjm4QAAG44Sj34vR3Yixz0QdsYxc6\nN8/3ygLrXkxJResA0K7uo5rwIh5sffofbVwDPMPxbgg/BAVx7QAhWrjdV2hTkx4t\nd4jwaxHXLWRBUhBsS0ioKJE8YKn1JthCCmDxLgN5PSWjftR1SKcPqho4xPYk72yH\n58J6H14PADhhmeIjfH/uFJ8QGMRUKNBpjAK3U0ICkePqBDa8p02zJb6+ns8/L7JN\n0ER/51DtCWPBAND/wzNlAhPaRo/BIx4jkVTFlS2UFuVcLDDVE22aGcQTdY6k3xUs\nlhLGzCkvQspZ9jz+uAOd58hJ+j2+H60RNMaokCUzlq8kyOJlETZb/Hr19Ax/dDkf\n5CjV+jrnfLx/7mtsvCEr6EEZ3x6zB1tNjdLUHGNYktUzDjdP517GrRgp9iH2A1wl\n5bn04NJojs8v5z3RHaBsdhjl+ilUILaMSVX7K2hmPRG7JVBJ4BPsh8mYfVW5HPsm\nLYa9F1wemXsFiPCYhg91AaW6ODgfN1M1k5NuIolo3f1v1QEaPpc4eS4/KFIvm1EO\nyftavhVQbBZ2dSjTV24w9yqURCOCXKEfy8fJuNbNq5gbdIk6HEFVFF+CVMBsd9Uy\nIa1rf4mRGIfPjoTqRjddLvGSl45mYuzLYJRUaloP9vwPEqUpVUAkIrstruB2MHxJ\n8hD1GJWrfKoh1sdf2Wz2\n=kYu6\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-07T09:35:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","followin