"name":"Michael Borck"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T05:44:00Z","email":"michael@borck.dev","name":"Michael Borck"},"message":"Add Briefing #4 semester-end check-in and three new Briefing ideas\n\nIssue #4 closes semester 1 with an orientation to what is already in\nthe Passport and asks SoMM colleagues to shape semester 2 (workshops,\none-on-ones, bespoke tools, live conversation sessions). Parks three\nfuture Briefing ideas: teaching AI to novices, AI in the trough of\ndisillusionment as a business school read, and a possible revisit of\nthe detection / Assessment 2030 / two-lane model material.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"69158402ee776220113d9052159582b0a5402756","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/git/trees/69158402ee776220113d9052159582b0a5402756"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/git/commits/40c4d6df346f2fe1241495884b8844e09298ed46","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commit/40c4d6df346f2fe1241495884b8844e09298ed46","node_id":"C_kwDORTCIu9oAKDQwYzRkNmRmMzQ2ZjJmZTEyNDE0OTU4ODRiODg0NGUwOTI5OGVkNDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commit/d64a0095c5eabf71debd47d048fa2f30316f3cd6","sha":"d64a0095c5eabf71debd47d048fa2f30316f3cd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commits/d64a0095c5eabf71debd47d048fa2f30316f3cd6"}],"sha":"40c4d6df346f2fe1241495884b8844e09298ed46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commits/40c4d6df346f2fe1241495884b8844e09298ed46"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commits/d64a0095c5eabf71debd47d048fa2f30316f3cd6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-2