":"michael@borck.dev","name":"Michael Borck"},"message":"Add prompt-context-harness page and RTCF prompting framework to AI Toolkit\n\n- prompt-context-harness.qmd: the three-layer progression as a friendly\n  walk-through. Explicit \"lower layers don''t go away\" message; pointer out\n  to LocoLab for the technical/research-side reader.\n- rtcf-prompting-framework.qmd: leaner four-part counterpart to CRAFT,\n  positioned as the author''s preferred framework. Tone folded into Format;\n  links to CRAFT for the deep section on conversational prompting.\n\nBoth pages still need to be registered in ai-toolkit/index.qmd''s resource list.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2fd29b355977dd2ddc31444dd369034350069c6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/git/trees/2fd29b355977dd2ddc31444dd369034350069c6f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/git/commits/124f1f9ed130aec457fd486feffe027de870e7ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commit/124f1f9ed130aec457fd486feffe027de870e7ad","node_id":"C_kwDORTCIu9oAKDEyNGYxZjllZDEzMGFlYzQ1N2ZkNDg2ZmVmZmUwMjdkZTg3MGU3YWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commit/96ca2bb4723027085029ccd6434c770e17e6b33a","sha":"96ca2bb4723027085029ccd6434c770e17e6b33a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commits/96ca2bb4723027085029ccd6434c770e17e6b33a"}],"sha":"124f1f9ed130aec457fd486feffe027de870e7ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commits/124f1f9ed130aec457fd486feffe027de870e7ad"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commits/96ca2bb4723027085029ccd6434c770e17e6b33a/comments","commit":{"author":{"d