.dev","name":"Michael Borck"},"message":"Add Fuse.js fuzzy search for beginner-friendly toolkit queries\n\nReplace exact substring matching with Fuse.js extended search. Queries\nare tokenised, stop words removed, and each word is fuzzy-matched (OR)\nacross title, summary, and content with weighted relevance ranking.\nPhrases like \"Getting started with AI\" now return meaningful results.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"34dc4c56e7a68e4d01e803bf20a1a2b35d9a0bbb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/git/trees/34dc4c56e7a68e4d01e803bf20a1a2b35d9a0bbb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/git/commits/112da88d49b0b2b6e65b5859859c3ebff9d15760","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commit/112da88d49b0b2b6e65b5859859c3ebff9d15760","node_id":"C_kwDORTCIu9oAKDExMmRhODhkNDliMGIyYjZlNjViNTg1OTg1OWMzZWJmZjlkMTU3NjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commit/d98be4e6597bb101166eabd23d961e8f24dc154d","sha":"d98be4e6597bb101166eabd23d961e8f24dc154d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commits/d98be4e6597bb101166eabd23d961e8f24dc154d"}],"sha":"112da88d49b0b2b6e65b5859859c3ebff9d15760","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commits/112da88d49b0b2b6e65b5859859c3ebff9d15760"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commits/d98be4e6597bb101166eabd23d961e8f24dc154d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-25T22:17:44Z","email":"michael@borck.dev","name":"Michael Borck"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-25T22:17:44Z","email":"michael@borck.dev","name":"Michael Borck"},"message":"Replace wall-of-cards default with search-first layout in 