c36b2eb4b9c9640e6791d0c87cc9f0d7ee"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commits/0835ff0074d7823899155fcbcc34bbeb65c13aef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-19T12:51:36Z","email":"michael@borck.dev","name":"Michael Borck"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-19T12:51:36Z","email":"michael@borck.dev","name":"Michael Borck"},"message":"Apply dark theme to all 8 Quarto SPAs for consistent branding\n\nAdd shared/brand.css with base dark theme styles and update all\n_quarto.yml files to reference it. Convert all inline styles and\nJavaScript-generated HTML from light to dark colour scheme across\nall experiences, onboarding, resources, and passport SPAs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ad1a7ef2e6d7ceb853840f67a73cdd143242041a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/git/trees/ad1a7ef2e6d7ceb853840f67a73cdd143242041a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/git/commits/0835ff0074d7823899155fcbcc34bbeb65c13aef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commit/0835ff0074d7823899155fcbcc34bbeb65c13aef","node_id":"C_kwDORTCIu9oAKDA4MzVmZjAwNzRkNzgyMzg5OTE1NWZjYmNjMzRiYmViNjVjMTNhZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commit/03c9a034056ace2ee5d86b6417de290cecce544c","sha":"03c9a034056ace2ee5d86b6417de290cecce544c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commits/03c9a034056ace2ee5d86b6417de290cecce544c"}],"sha":"0835ff0074d7823899155fcbcc34bbeb65c13aef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commits/0835ff0074d7823899155fcbcc34bbeb65c13aef"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commits/03c9a034056ace2ee5d86b6417de290cecce544c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-19T12:19:45Z","email":"michael@borck.dev","name":"Michael Borck"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-19T12:19:45Z","email":"michael@borck.dev","name":"Michael Borck"},"message":"Rebrand all Blackboard pages with dark theme and bold typography\n\nUnified visual identity across all 7 Blackboard pages: dark navy\nbackground (#1A1A2E), bold multi-colour headlines (white/orange/gold),\nconsistent card style, collapsible sections, and system sans-serif font.\nReplaces the previous light LMS-style design with a modern, cohesive\nbrand that feels like a product rather than courseware.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"af383077f5b4c1b4166e2c62fbca6ced904a027e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/git/trees/af383077f5b4c1b4166e2c62fbca6ced904a027e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/git/commits/03c9a034056ace2ee5d86b6417de290cecce544c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commit/03c9a034056ace2ee5d86b6417de290cecce544c","node_id":"C_kwDORTCIu9oAKDAzYzlhMDM0MDU2YWNlMmVlNWQ4NmI2NDE3ZGUyOTBjZWNjZTU0NGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commit/a822a316c2210457f16215234125a72f0e59083e","sha":"a822a316c2210457f16215234125a72f0e59083e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commits/a822a316c2210457f16215234125a72f0e59083e"}],"sha":"03c9a034056ace2ee5d86b6417de290cecce544c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commits/03c9a034056ace2ee5d86b6417de290cecce544c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commits/a822a316c2210457f16215234125a7