.com/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commit/f4496761cd5f2edab51044e063c2670690ffd115","node_id":"C_kwDORTCIu9oAKGY0NDk2NzYxY2Q1ZjJlZGFiNTEwNDRlMDYzYzI2NzA2OTBmZmQxMTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commit/58151e462cf70a0c35813c485a1d89ce611a6642","sha":"58151e462cf70a0c35813c485a1d89ce611a6642","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commits/58151e462cf70a0c35813c485a1d89ce611a6642"}],"sha":"f4496761cd5f2edab51044e063c2670690ffd115","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commits/f4496761cd5f2edab51044e063c2670690ffd115"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commits/58151e462cf70a0c35813c485a1d89ce611a6642/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-18T13:56:28Z","email":"michael@borck.dev","name":"Michael Borck"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-18T13:56:28Z","email":"michael@borck.dev","name":"Michael Borck"},"message":"Update AI Exchange card description to focus on value proposition\n\nChanged from feature list to \"why would I bother\" framing:\n\"Who else in the school is working on something like this? Search by\ndiscipline, browse anonymously, or register what you''ve tried — even\nthe failures.\"\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f4aca313956c8a2bd3dea5d7ec406664cb327419","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/git/trees/f4aca313956c8a2bd3dea5d7ec406664cb327419"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/git/commits/58151e462cf70a0c35813c485a1d89ce611a6642","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commit/58151e462cf70a0c35813c485a1d89ce611a6642","node_id":"C_kwDORTCIu9oAKDU4MTUxZTQ2MmNmNzBhMGMzNTgxM2M0ODVhMWQ4OWNlNjExYTY2NDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commit/7c3e75a5017d0de4ba1f4f3e8557ee74a57eaed6","sha":"7c3e75a5017d0de4ba1f4f3e8557ee74a57eaed6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commits/7c3e75a5017d0de4ba1f4f3e8557ee74a57eaed6"}],"sha":"58151e462cf70a0c35813c485a1d89ce611a6642","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commits/58151e462cf70a0c35813c485a1d89ce611a6642"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commits/7c3e75a5017d0de4ba1f4f3e8557ee74a57eaed6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-18T13:54:01Z","email":"michael@borck.dev","name":"Michael Borck"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-18T13:54:01Z","email":"michael@borck.dev","name":"Michael Borck"},"message":"Add book links: Conversation Not Delegation & Partner Don''t Police\n\n- AI Toolkit: Add Books category with both titles\n- AI Toolkit: Add \"Read the full book\" link to Conversation framework\n- Experience 4: Add Partner Don''t Police reference in Next Steps\n- Experience 5: Add Partner Don''t Police Next Steps section\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1e7431617d9738b7a59431f85b0599291e88ef84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/git/trees/1e7431617d9738b7a59431f85b0599291e88ef84"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/git/commits/7c3e75a5017d0de4ba1f4f3e8557ee74a57eaed6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commit/7c3e75a5017d0de4ba1f4f3e8557ee74a57eaed6","node_id":"C_kwDORTCIu9oAKDdjM2U3NWE1MDE3ZDBkZTRiYTFmNGYzZTg1NTdlZTc0YTU3ZWFlZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commit/d5480253314fcd4534bf8f181b42956db994f2e5","sha":"d5480253314fcd4534bf8f181b42956db994f2e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commits/d5480253314fcd4534bf8f181b42956db994f2e5"}],"sha":"7c3e75a5017d0de4ba1f4f3e8557ee74a57eaed6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commits/7c3e75a5017d0de4ba1f4f3e8557ee74a57eaed6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commits/d5480253314fcd4534bf8f181b42956db994f2e5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-18T13:49:45Z","email":"michael@borck.dev","name":"Michael Borck"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-18T13:49:45Z","email":"michael@borck.dev","name":"Michael Borck"},"message":"Add foundational philosophy: Conversation Not Delegation + Agentic AI Paradox\n\nNew framework - \"Conversation, Not Delegation\":\n- Positioned as the lead framework (before RTCF)\n- Delegation vs Conversation mindset comparison\n- \"Process over product\" philosophy\n- \"Judgment can''t be delegated to something that''s read everything but experienced nothing\"\n\nNew guide - \"The Agentic AI Paradox\":\n- Why autonomous AI requires MORE human judgment, not less\n- Three critical human roles: defining good, setting constraints, knowing when to override\n- Delegation approach = \"confident, unsupervised mediocrity at scale\"\n- Amplification approach = \"dramatic outperformance\"\n- Implications for teaching, research, and admin\n\nThese establish the philosophical foundation for the entire AI Skills Passport.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"37a74534d9ff5558fd71be292ce76284ecd319a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/git/trees/37a74534d9ff5558fd71be292ce76284ecd319a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/git/commits/d5480253314fcd4534bf8f181b42956db994f2e5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commit/d5480253314fcd4534bf8f181b42956db994f2e5","node_id":"C_kwDORTCIu9oAKGQ1NDgwMjUzMzE0ZmNkNDUzNGJmOGYxODFiNDI5NTZkYjk5NGYyZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commit/97c59b49bc148917b0f4fe42dc17ec48a178c93f","sha":"97c59b49bc148917b0f4fe42dc17ec48a178c93f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commits/97c59b49bc148917b0f4fe42dc17ec48a178c93f"}],"sha":"d5480253314fcd4534bf8f181b42956db994f2e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commits/d5480253314fcd4534bf8f181b42956db994f2e5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commits/97c59b49bc148917b0f4fe42dc17ec48a178c93f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-18T13:45:56Z","email":"michael@borck.dev","name":"Michael Borck"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-18T13:45:56Z","email":"michael@borck.dev","name":"Michael Borck"},"message":"Replace curated papers with evergreen search queries\n\nFurther Reading section now provides:\n- Google Scholar pre-built searches (5 topics)\n- arXiv searches for cutting-edge research (3 topics)\n- Library search terms for institutional databases\n- Links to curated external hubs (UNESCO, JISC, EDUCAUSE)\n\nThis approach is:\n- Zero maintenance (searches always return fresh results)\n- Empowering (teaches staff how to find resources)\n- Evergreen (won''t go stale)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"76ed5425a04edfde2a24926f671c76faefafacb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/git/trees/76ed5425a04edfde2a24926f671c76faefafacb1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/git/commits/97c59b49bc148917b0f4fe42dc17ec48a178c93f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commit/97c59b49bc148917b0f4fe42dc17ec48a178c93f","node_id":"C_kwDORTCIu9oAKDk3YzU5YjQ5YmMxNDg5MTdiMGY0ZmU0MmRjMTdlYzQ4YTE3OGM5M2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commit/239bbd67d288477dc4bf69011f74eb4767030e7c","sha":"239bbd67d288477dc4bf69011f74eb4767030e7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commits/239bbd67d288477dc4bf69011f74eb4767030e7c"}],"sha":"97c59b49bc148917b0f4fe42dc17ec48a178c93f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commits/97c59b49bc148917b0f4fe42dc17ec48a178c93f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commits/239bbd67d288477dc4bf69011f74eb4767030e7c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-18T13:41:57Z","email":"michael@borck.dev","name":"Michael Borck"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-18T13:41:57Z","email":"michael@borck.dev","name":"Michael Borck"},"message":"Build complete AI Skills Passport with all SPAs and infrastructure\n\nNew SPAs:\n- onboarding/: Find Your Path quiz (10 questions, pathway recommendations)\n- resources/: AI Toolkit (searchable frameworks, techniques, templates, guides, further reading)\n- passport/: My Passport badge tracker (localStorage-based progress display)\n\nAll 5 experiences fully built with:\n- Interactive activities and role-based tabs (Teaching/Research/Admin)\n- Consistent visual design (dark headers, Georgia font, inline CSS)\n- localStorage completion tracking with badge progression\n\nInfrastructure:\n- server/: FastAPI progress tracker (~75 lines, SQLite, /complete and /progress endpoints)\n- experiences/_shared/: Reusable completion-tracker component\n\nDocumentation:\n- docs/deployment-guide.md: Full Quarto render and Blackboard upload workflow\n- docs/scaffold-guide.md: Updated for 3-item sidebar philosophy (minimal BB footprint)\n- CLAUDE.md: Updated architecture reflecting \"Blackboard as shell\" approach\n- README.md: Current project structure\n\nArrivals Hall updates:\n- All experience cards now clickable with URL placeholders\n- AI Exchange card linked with [EXCHANGE_URL]\n- AI Toolkit and My Passport linked\n- URL placeholder reference at top for easy find/replace\n\nAI Toolkit includes:\n- RTCF framework, Opportunity Finder, Verification Mindset\n- 6 techniques (Board of Directors, Devil''s Advocate, etc.)\n- Templates (syllabus policies, disclosure, emails, discipline prompts)\n- Guides (AI shame, progressive integration, classroom activities)\n- Further reading (research papers with DOI links)\n- AI-Integrated Assessment Rubrics template\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5549ac381ce58efcf2a6b1867fd20d161451d77b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/git/trees/5549ac381ce58efcf2a6b1867fd20d161451d77b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/git/commits/239bbd67d288477dc4bf69011f74eb4767030e7c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commit/239bbd67d288477dc4bf69011f74eb4767030e7c","node_id":"C_kwDORTCIu9oAKDIzOWJiZDY3ZDI4ODQ3N2RjNGJmNjkwMTFmNzRlYjQ3NjcwMzBlN2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commit/b0686e20945bf938cb42ba231a52d83172486850","sha":"b0686e20945bf938cb42ba231a52d83172486850","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commits/b0686e20945bf938cb42ba231a52d83172486850"}],"sha":"239bbd67d288477dc4bf69011f74eb4767030e7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michael-borck/the-ai-skills-passport/commits/239bbd67d288477dc4bf69011f74eb4767030e7c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"htt